    <node id="军品供应商">
      <data key="d0">军品供应商</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">军品供应商refers to military product suppliers, a role held by the issuer that requires strict quality management and qualifications.&lt;SEP&gt;军品供应商指公司作为向军方提供产品的供应商，需严格执行武器装备质量管理要求。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-838daaa18fa926fb2b11fc99c8bb90e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5876c16db338055a4b093d71d08df2e4</data>
