    <node id="装备采购方式与程序管理规定">
      <data key="d0">装备采购方式与程序管理规定</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">装备采购方式与程序管理规定是公司部分产品需遵循的采购规定，涉及成本费用编制。&lt;SEP&gt;《装备采购方式与程序管理规定》是规范装备采购流程的法规文件，影响公司销售合同条款。&lt;SEP&gt;《装备采购方式与程序管理规定》于2003年实施，由中国人民解放军总装备部主管，规范了装备采购方式与程序管理，提高采购效益。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-838daaa18fa926fb2b11fc99c8bb90e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8455459f679507928ed432ed0eeb11a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35d5ae0cd3bef83c69a9a04359fd3085</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780276284</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Investor Concerns">
      <data key="d0">Investor Concerns</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Investor concerns refer to the anxieties and apprehensions held by investors, specifically regarding rising interest rates and regulatory uncertainty. These concerns are identified as a primary and key factor driving a market selloff. The anxieties stem from the potential negative impacts that higher interest rates and an unclear or changing regulatory environment could have on investment returns and market stability. As a result, these collective worries have been cited as the direct reason for the observed decline in market values.&lt;SEP&gt;Investor concerns over rising interest rates and regulatory uncertainty are a key factor driving the market selloff.&lt;SEP&gt;Investor concerns over rising interest rates and regulatory uncertainty are a key factor driving the market selloff.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-838daaa18fa926fb2b11fc99c8bb90e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c26164881792d8f22527b18d87fd2220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8455459f679507928ed432ed0eeb11a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8073427e62e9928dc9d4d2e1bf551bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89db22b0e5a6074ecc3ea2ba20783879&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a9fb477f1282bec83a5049704e5318c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ba10301a1cc50aa00b42c346bc0be73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6a85b577f748f823a732efe5f33bcc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-560cb7117e9d5c8fe2ebe3fce7fe2b14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bba9eac029b302aabf1571d3c8bb5ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4426fe3d656d20408ebd50181707d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2273ac3cd308f24a535921577d4315a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f4ab7f804bdb6f3a234651e9ddad7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd0253c8fd4cf1a734f1e20c69452e83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014987a28aa1c57e58428f91364dc2ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1463edc09712687df6ac0fa315e9b199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d107e1458c0a41e0ea70ff881142527d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8206957ceb85ffe01f41376b51df1aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6218739cb192cff96f29ab446f3c5a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-990274235a3a49eed4cdcbefe01ab063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25bb161f5a3eed908ebf574181f3cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395c544cbdbc0fb5c7f956be865084b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e15bacdff9b9dbac1e607320b745d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba9e539e2a95244b725131333cf02b15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-509b7e822bffbfde184be47ea8af2501&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc982eece00e588340b45e4d5d4a2085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2d90f0e9b01f197bbeb7088e31fb78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-324eb4ef8addf9cdfe9e75559c95ba96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d87bc8720f0c140e823bbd72c42ba464&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99024b6acfbff5fe61121f4e30753fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faeec762f48630cc3f1c9539369a799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0233c72dd0d594d28f50bc3b23148a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d9d0f08c60fc1566be4d59b80e3ce8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96b26bf1a1bea07789c4fbf62c5edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781a874dfa08b29a9052bcfdfde2061b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-953a39fa41a80653a06efc40f9ac9543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d3373fcf196abd13ecb0324900615ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac067e676c221352a5db759969360171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee4e0bc4d3f900c9271fab93b63caf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd183f52aef1