    <node id="Federal Reserve">
      <data key="d0">Federal Reserve</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Federal Reserve is the central bank and central banking system of the United States. Its policy decisions and announcements are closely monitored by financial experts and are expected to significantly influence investor confidence, financial markets, interest rates, and overall market stability. The institution’s upcoming policy announcements are specifically anticipated to have a notable impact on these areas, shaping the economic outlook and guiding market behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;The Federal Reserve is the central bank of the United States, whose policy decisions are closely watched by financial experts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-838daaa18fa926fb2b11fc99c8bb90e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8455459f679507928ed432ed0eeb11a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8073427e62e9928dc9d4d2e1bf551bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-560cb7117e9d5c8fe2ebe3fce7fe2b14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bba9eac029b302aabf1571d3c8bb5ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74df7cf01c247ecef37cb477bc0fe0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a439299f90cd269df576a65e3aec0bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25bb161f5a3eed908ebf574181f3cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395c544cbdbc0fb5c7f956be865084b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16dbba47d97c65bf8e82845fca5a61d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2d90f0e9b01f197bbeb7088e31fb78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96b26bf1a1bea07789c4fbf62c5edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3104b9748246bf1c1b596137af31103a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f59a37440ab95ef90b5519bda697b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd183f52aef118cb63810c498ab8550&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e6ef010bba2a819545e29f981f9a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa3063ca8148fef0d6b0b98a6b6e563&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2969d49dd5c9133ebf9e2c6cfd697131&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-507e2b6ca2f473187fea2747ef444ec5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb09edb1098f9d43c10eb37e8eaf03aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fca02fbab0d237ce11800b5b73d4efd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e343e9f8cca7465d3a833f634c92cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f958e8631e69a2a723215ed2bf5fee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f1e82c399c9fc61f39afa09aee92cfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a754cb39a70a7b6942e8d85cc566af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9a0ecb1bc6254dade0144761cc9d208&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85051b285f1c500763f83db7eb74a280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d012b93d8b658c8e32c326d8f1e487&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af143b0c95988c6fbd428d9191ea6fe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da8fc31188e449d6106dadda0587623f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-931e9f8ff947a254d2e37023beedf406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc250dce92b40961347f8667cb257c01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8612b7b1b05a28fa57b957d874cafa2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24df38475c78597e2425c954a91f189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aff45bd2991eea001d4c432822ce81f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14aa9b61d5d5a1090625ae2c5607e5b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed565c5f9a9bd6219205c7dd5b0012f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3de0c8b0c77ab6bc474ead023bc128f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae7a1fcdcb4a