    <node id="Supply Constraints">
      <data key="d0">Supply Constraints</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Supply Constraints refer to limitations or restrictions on the availability of crude oil within the global market. These constraints are fundamentally defined as limitations in the availability of key resources, such as crude oil, which directly affect market prices. By restricting the supply of oil available to meet existing demand, supply constraints create upward pressure on prices. Consequently, they are identified as a significant factor that supports and contributes to a sustained increase, or rally, in crude oil prices.

Across multiple descriptions, supply constraints in the oil market are repeatedly characterized as a factor supporting the rally in crude oil prices and contributing to rising crude oil price increases. They are consistently described as limitations in oil supply that supported the rally in crude oil prices, reinforcing their role as a fundamental driver of upward price movements in the global oil market. The presence of these constraints is consistently cited as a key driver behind rising and higher crude oil prices.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c26164881792d8f22527b18d87fd2220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89db22b0e5a6074ecc3ea2ba20783879&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a9fb477f1282bec83a5049704e5318c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ba10301a1cc50aa00b42c346bc0be73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6a85b577f748f823a732efe5f33bcc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-560cb7117e9d5c8fe2ebe3fce7fe2b14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4426fe3d656d20408ebd50181707d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2273ac3cd308f24a535921577d4315a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f4ab7f804bdb6f3a234651e9ddad7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd0253c8fd4cf1a734f1e20c69452e83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014987a28aa1c57e58428f91364dc2ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8206957ceb85ffe01f41376b51df1aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6218739cb192cff96f29ab446f3c5a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-990274235a3a49eed4cdcbefe01ab063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395c544cbdbc0fb5c7f956be865084b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba9e539e2a95244b725131333cf02b15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-509b7e822bffbfde184be47ea8af2501&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc982eece00e588340b45e4d5d4a2085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2d90f0e9b01f197bbeb7088e31fb78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-324eb4ef8addf9cdfe9e75559c95ba96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99024b6acfbff5fe61121f4e30753fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faeec762f48630cc3f1c9539369a799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0233c72dd0d594d28f50bc3b23148a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d9d0f08c60fc1566be4d59b80e3ce8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781a874dfa08b29a9052bcfdfde2061b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-953a39fa41a80653a06efc40f9ac9543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac067e676c221352a5db759969360171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee4e0bc4d3f900c9271fab93b63caf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b606597aae507436e4bc3368049cab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35d5ae0cd3bef83c69a9a04359fd3085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14d4e7213768e5a9d7a66bec241ce01e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e827ebe778b4fe39c952a40be61f9bc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-524e4292263105f9427d5413618e9c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8d08b51b94e473897b7e18847e55ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b84096a6e6d9f55493f1531e413c38d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-654210e4a83c095d604993852216dccb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e66405bf753e63b7b1c564dd5e86db9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58b70a42920a91dffdca8121d66a66eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5c0c72057a06