    <node id="Rising Oil Prices">
      <data key="d0">Rising Oil Prices</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Rising Oil Prices refer to a market condition or trend characterized by an increase in the cost of crude oil. This phenomenon is primarily driven by supply constraints and strong demand, which together create upward pressure on prices. As a market trend, rising oil prices positively impact the financial performance of energy companies, most notably benefiting firms such as Omega Energy. Specifically, this condition has been observed to boost Omega Energy's stock performance, with one instance reporting a gain of 2.1%, and to support the value of crude oil futures. The trend also influences broader commodity markets, as rising oil prices help sustain higher crude oil prices overall. The driving factors of supply constraints and strong demand are consistently cited as the primary causes of this upward price movement, and the condition is repeatedly described as a market trend that benefits energy companies like Omega Energy.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c26164881792d8f22527b18d87fd2220&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89db22b0e5a6074ecc3ea2ba20783879&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a9fb477f1282bec83a5049704e5318c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ba10301a1cc50aa00b42c346bc0be73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6a85b577f748f823a732efe5f33bcc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-560cb7117e9d5c8fe2ebe3fce7fe2b14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4426fe3d656d20408ebd50181707d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2273ac3cd308f24a535921577d4315a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f4ab7f804bdb6f3a234651e9ddad7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd0253c8fd4cf1a734f1e20c69452e83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014987a28aa1c57e58428f91364dc2ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8206957ceb85ffe01f41376b51df1aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6218739cb192cff96f29ab446f3c5a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-990274235a3a49eed4cdcbefe01ab063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395c544cbdbc0fb5c7f956be865084b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba9e539e2a95244b725131333cf02b15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-509b7e822bffbfde184be47ea8af2501&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc982eece00e588340b45e4d5d4a2085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2d90f0e9b01f197bbeb7088e31fb78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-324eb4ef8addf9cdfe9e75559c95ba96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99024b6acfbff5fe61121f4e30753fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faeec762f48630cc3f1c9539369a799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0233c72dd0d594d28f50bc3b23148a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d9d0f08c60fc1566be4d59b80e3ce8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781a874dfa08b29a9052bcfdfde2061b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-953a39fa41a80653a06efc40f9ac9543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac067e676c221352a5db759969360171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee4e0bc4d3f900c9271fab93b63caf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b606597aae507436e4bc3368049cab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14d4e7213768e5a9d7a66bec241ce01e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e827ebe778b4fe39c952a40be61f9bc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-524e4292263105f9427d5413618e9c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8d08b51b94e473897b7e18847e55ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b84096a6e6d9f55493f1531e413c38d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-654210e4a83c095d604993852216dccb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e66405bf753e63b7b1c564dd5e86db9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58b70a42920a91dffdca8121d66a66eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5c0c72057a06111028608a0973aef2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2be25df1af7e3