    <node id="军改">
      <data key="d0">军改</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">军改，全称为国防和军队改革，是指为贯彻落实党中央、习近平主席的战略部署和决策指示，由中央军委于2016年1月1日印发并实施《中央军委关于深化国防和军队改革的意见》后正式启动的新一轮军事改革。该改革始于2015年底，并在2016年全面展开，其核心目标是深化国防和军队体制的调整与优化。

在改革推进过程中，军改对相关行业和企业产生了显著影响。由于改革导致军方采购计划、订单及合同出现推迟或取消，许多企业在2016年的业务规模受到冲击，表现为收入规模较小、净利润下降（例如某公司净利润仅为460.98万元），以及劳务和技术服务的采购金额减少。然而，随着改革的逐步深化，军改也促进了国防信息化建设，并推动了对视频指挥控制等产品的需求增长，从而在长期内为相关领域带来了新的市场机遇。&lt;SEP&gt;军改refers to the military reform that began in 2016, impacting procurement and order execution for military clients.&lt;SEP&gt;军改refers to military reform that impacted the company's revenue in 2016.&lt;SEP&gt;军改refers to military reforms that impacted procurement in 2016, causing extreme values in operational indicators.&lt;SEP&gt;军改is a military reform event that affected the company's sales revenue in 2016.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52f4ab7f804bdb6f3a234651e9ddad7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d012b93d8b658c8e32c326d8f1e487&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d8506c960bd0285b9b0bf9389aba42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f076d85db2467f92db8296b25952dd82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-713ce2985a5928404c7e469db525578d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0a095e584ed3b2151ee03451073aae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14aa9b61d5d5a1090625ae2c5607e5b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f50b98f3148cfa787df9553aa64c7e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b709c7a89c74bf17a7f106e614fdf37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0716abb3520ec176e6192d2f96150520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bebcff7a955f77172a16384e24aabab1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280187</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="C4ISR系统">
      <data key="d0">C4ISR系统</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">C4ISR系统是指挥、控制、通信、计算机、情报、监视、侦察的缩写，是美国军事指挥当局作出重大战略决策以及战略部队的指挥员对其所属部队实施指挥控制、进行管理时所用的设备、器材、程序的总称。&lt;SEP&gt;C4ISR系统是美军指挥信息系统的代称，相当于国防指挥信息系统。&lt;SEP&gt;C4ISR系统是美军的指挥、控制、通信、计算机、情报、监视和侦察系统，作为某工程的类比对象。&lt;SEP&gt;C4ISR系统是美军电子信息系统发展的最终形态，旨在帮助美军获得信息、决策和作战行动优势。&lt;SEP&gt;C4ISR系统是美军指挥控制系统的统称，兴图新科的产品是其子系统。&lt;SEP&gt;C4ISR系统是美军的综合电子信息系统，包括指挥、控制、通信、计算机、情报、监视、侦察七个部分。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89db22b0e5a6074ecc3ea2ba20783879&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99024b6acfbff5fe61121f4e30753fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96b26bf1a1bea07789c4fbf62c5edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-953a39fa41a80653a06efc40f9ac9543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c8415832dc30b799cda20009a7019</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780278579</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="编解码器">
      <data key="d0">编解码器</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">编解码器是一种能够对数字视频进行压缩或解压缩的程序或设备，同时也是多媒体协同交互系统的主要硬件，用于音视频信号的编码和解码。作为视音频系统的核心硬件，编解码器在信号处理过程中承担着关键作用。该设备是兴图新科电子股份有限公司自主生产的核心设备之一，也是该公司单独销售的设备之一，广泛应用于视音频信号的编码和解码任务。编解码器的生产过程包括硬件电路设计、定制化编解码卡生产、软件烧录以及矩阵机箱组装，其功能核心在于公司自主研发的硬件电路和编解码软件。&lt;SEP&gt;编解码器is the main self-manufactured product of the company, assembled from externally procured components and programmed with company software.&lt;SEP&gt;编解码器is a hardware product used in video command control and video warning control systems.&lt;SEP&gt;编解码器is a hardware product, specifically codecs, sold by the company.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014987a28aa1c57e58428f91364dc2ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1463edc09712687df6ac0fa315e9b199&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd183f52aef118cb63810c498ab8550&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd227209a3be82add1bb0739321fb117&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d46ce39bcb98cf95aae86a3c40cffd03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b606597aae507436e4bc3368049cab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0099d5a68aa2a54c0a612a238ad5ba37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b3d1c3a20dfbb1aa241c83ed13bf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09841b91427b70d08c09d01179754ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75655ab366b5c847fe0116fe140d77a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24d2a0eeb5394c1bb2920dce48699105</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780278539</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="背靠背">
      <data key="d0">背靠背</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">背靠背指企业与客户签订合同中约定的回款条款，客户的回款进度取决于最终客户支付款项的进度，客户收到最终用户款。&lt;SEP&gt;背靠背是一种回款条款，客户的回款进度取决于最终客户支付款项的进度，客户收到最终用户款项后同步向兴图新科付款。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014987a28aa1c57e58428f91364dc2ca</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780275336</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Investor Confidence">
      <data key="d0">Investor Confidence</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Investor confidence is the overall sentiment, level of trust, and optimism that investors hold regarding the stability and future performance of the financial markets. It is defined as a key factor and sentiment that influences overall market stability, serving as both a consequence of policy decisions and a determinant of market health. The relationship between investor confidence, Federal Reserve policy, and market stability is reciprocal and dynamic, creating a feedback loop where policy announcements directly impact sentiment, the resulting confidence drives market stability, and overall market conditions subsequently influence investor confidence.

Investor confidence is significantly influenced by the policy announcements and decisions made by the Federal Reserve. Specifically, it is expected to be affected by the Federal Reserve's upcoming policy announcements, as these communications can alter perceptions of economic direction and risk. Beyond central bank policy, investor confidence is also shaped by overall market conditions, economic conditions, and the general sentiment of market participants.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89db22b0e5a6074ecc3ea2ba20783879&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a9fb477f1282bec83a5049704e5318c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ba10301a1cc50aa00b42c346bc0be73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6a85b577f748f823a732efe5f33bcc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4426fe3d656d20408ebd50181707d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd0253c8fd4cf1a734f1e20c69452e83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-838daaa18fa926fb2b11fc99c8bb90e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-990274235a3a49eed4cdcbefe01ab063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba9e539e2a95244b725131333cf02b15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc982eece00e588340b45e4d5d4a2085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2d90f0e9b01f197bbeb7088e31fb78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-324eb4ef8addf9cdfe9e75559c95ba96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99024b6acfbff5fe61121f4e30753fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0233c72dd0d594d28f50bc3b23148a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d9d0f08c60fc1566be4d59b80e3ce8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-781a874dfa08b29a9052bcfdfde2061b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-953a39fa41a80653a06efc40f9ac9543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee4e0bc4d3f900c9271fab93b63caf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35d5ae0cd3bef83c69a9a04359fd3085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14d4e7213768e5a9d7a66bec241ce01e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e827ebe778b4fe39c952a40be61f9bc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-524e4292263105f9427d5413618e9c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8d08b51b94e473897b7e18847e55ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-654210e4a83c095d604993852216dccb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e66405bf753e63b7b1c564dd5e86db9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5c0c72057a06111028608a0973aef2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81c4ac9baa1da2ddd370522010ecbe0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2be25df1af7e30c6a7392305cb22b52d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb1ce8466eba9fca5a2139cfe96ff1c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12718f6cef7063564c4af67b1701c06b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd4725f61a32f7fdf146cfa86e9ffbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67c4855ed613e5a5fb6557e3b5e3f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-715426c8536b679514108da2caab6b17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-296a72753256021351c386543f50f98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2bef4da9888c968bf50ff56e94e6b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3886638a85ee14393d1da2d826028ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68fc75e0518c7a7c27f8e04edf36f2d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71315edcb276c478ee7e17161d92bff9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89b412cfc15b0