    <node id="Lower-Than-Expected Quarterly Earnings">
      <data key="d0">Lower-Than-Expected Quarterly Earnings</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Nexon Technologies reported lower-than-expected quarterly earnings, an event that led to a significant decline in its stock price. The stock decline was specifically measured at 7.8%. This financial result negatively impacted investor sentiment, causing a notable drop in the company's market valuation following the earnings announcement.&lt;SEP&gt;Nexon Technologies reported lower-than-expected quarterly earnings, leading to a 7.8% stock decline.&lt;SEP&gt;Nexon Technologies reported lower-than-expected quarterly earnings, leading to a significant stock decline.&lt;SEP&gt;Nexon Technologies reported lower-than-expected quarterly earnings, leading to a 7.8% stock decline.&lt;SEP&gt;Nexon Technologies reported lower-than-expected quarterly earnings, leading to a significant stock decline.</data>
