      <data key="d0">存货账面余额</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">存货账面余额is the book value of inventory, which as of June 30, 2019, was 3,897.65万元for the issuer.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a9fb477f1282bec83a5049704e5318c</data>
