    <node id="存货跌价准备">
      <data key="d0">存货跌价准备</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">存货跌价准备is the provision for inventory devaluation, totaling 397.99万元for inventory aged over 2 years as of June 30, 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;存货跌价准备is a provision for decline in value of inventory, which was significant in 2018 due to H.264 encoding equipment.&lt;SEP&gt;存货跌价准备是为应对存货价值下降而计提的准备金，各期末金额分别为0万元、23.23万元、349.70万元和397.99万元。&lt;SEP&gt;存货跌价准备是公司根据会计准则对存货成本高于可变现净值部分计提的减值准备。&lt;SEP&gt;存货跌价准备is an accounting provision for inventory write-downs, calculated based on the lower of cost and net realizable value.&lt;SEP&gt;存货跌价准备is an inventory write-down provision that creates deductible temporary differences for deferred tax assets.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a9fb477f1282bec83a5049704e5318c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eee2c091e44ba62cc1d372bad97085a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b6eddb53d74c83ec7f5f6b39738bdf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8176626e00ddc22142d6204442ab4426&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf6871fb0e492a04ff169463c40073a3</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279675</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="税收优惠政策变动风险">
      <data key="d0">税收优惠政策变动风险</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">税收优惠政策变动风险is the risk of changes in tax preferential policies, including the 15% corporate income tax rate for high-tech enterprises and VAT refund policies for military and software products.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a9fb477f1282bec83a5049704e5318c</data>
