    <node id="应收账款周转天数">
      <data key="d0">应收账款周转天数</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">应收账款周转天数是衡量发行人回款周期的财务指标，2016至2018年分别为493.24天、296.75天和323.01天。&lt;SEP&gt;应收账款周转天数是反映公司从销售到收回现金所需平均天数的指标。&lt;SEP&gt;应收账款周转天数is the number of days it takes for a company to collect its accounts receivable.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ba10301a1cc50aa00b42c346bc0be73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e827ebe778b4fe39c952a40be61f9bc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0716abb3520ec176e6192d2f96150520</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280187</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="民用市场">
      <data key="d0">民用市场</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">民用市场是发行人除国防指挥信息系统外的业务领域，包括监狱、油田等通信领域，报告期内收入占比较低。&lt;SEP&gt;民用市场is the civilian market that the company entered in 2016 with micro projector products.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ba10301a1cc50aa00b42c346bc0be73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da8fc31188e449d6106dadda0587623f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780278475</data>
