    <node id="科创板">
      <data key="d0">科创板</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">科创板是上海证券交易所的一个板块，具有较高的投资风险，公司研发投入大、经营风险高、业绩不稳定、退市风险高。&lt;SEP&gt;科创板is the Science and Technology Innovation Board of the Shanghai Stock Exchange where the company plans to list.&lt;SEP&gt;科创板是上海证券交易所设立的板块，重点支持新一代信息技术等领域的企业上市。&lt;SEP&gt;科创板is a stock market board for technology companies, where北京国科环宇科技股份有限公司applied for listing.&lt;SEP&gt;科创板是上海证券交易所设立的板块，专门服务于符合国家战略、突破关键核心技术、市场认可度高的科技创新企业。&lt;SEP&gt;科创板是中国上海证券交易所设立的板块，专注于支持科技创新企业上市。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3bba9eac029b302aabf1571d3c8bb5ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4426fe3d656d20408ebd50181707d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f59a37440ab95ef90b5519bda697b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8558b195ba00af38286850b482d4bbf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f72c84ae0acbd2472ea50de1b750541e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96c42ede41c6ff4d6a78647f8a045bc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280457</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="上海证券交易所">
      <data key="d0">上海证券交易所</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Shanghai Stock Exchange (SSE) is a major stock exchange in China that operates the Science and Technology Innovation Board (STAR Market). It serves as the proposed listing venue for the initial public offering of shares, including for companies such as Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd. The SSE functions as both a trading platform and a regulatory authority. In its regulatory capacity, it oversees listed companies and their shareholders, issuing guidelines such as the "Recommendation Guidelines for Enterprise Listing on the STAR Market." The SSE also enforces compliance with share lock-up commitments and governs the reduction and trading of shares by shareholders, imposing regulatory measures on parties that fail to meet their obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;上海证券交易所is the stock exchange whose rules govern the repricing of shares after corporate actions like dividends or stock splits.&lt;SEP&gt;上海证券交易所是证券交易场所，负责对上市公司及相关主体进行监管。&lt;SEP&gt;上海证券交易所is the stock exchange that specifies rules for identifying related parties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3bba9eac029b302aabf1571d3c8bb5ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb54c5118e1ed95515ee7fc4eb482abd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4426fe3d656d20408ebd50181707d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f59a37440ab95ef90b5519bda697b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ce498c7ddd5c009a90ed486bcfceca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63e5d2afa2bb086b998b098937fd536f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d9a4204a692f6b81c2913448119a51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40b9d69bbf62abe14ff7f951a8f1b3dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ac79bf5c8fd0e1655f57c0fdc3c54fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab4bf4932d168a325f6494b1024eab4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f72c84ae0acbd2472ea50de1b750541e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6fc09ed3694cfe56cf8f65ff5ee302c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-429754eb2ecdebc430531262f856dab5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280457</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="中国证监会">
      <data key="d0">中国证监会</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The China Securities Regulatory Commission (中国证监会), also known as the CSRC, is the primary securities regulatory authority in China, responsible for overseeing the nation's securities markets and stock market activities. As a government agency, it supervises listed companies and the issuance of securities, including making determinations or opinions on public offerings. The CSRC has the authority to confirm whether a company meets the conditions for listing and issuance, and it is also responsible for identifying instances of fraudulent issuance. While it oversees the registration process, the CSRC does not guarantee the truthfulness, accuracy, or completeness of registration application documents.

The CSRC establishes and enforces regulations concerning various corporate activities, including the use of raised funds, adjustments to profit distribution policies, and the classification of listed companies, as exemplified by its publication of the "Industry Classification Guidelines for Listed Companies." Furthermore, the CSRC designates specific newspapers and media outlets for public announcements and information disclosure, setting the rules and media requirements that listed companies must follow to ensure transparency and compliance with regulatory standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3bba9eac029b302aabf1571d3c8bb5ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb54c5118e1ed95515ee7fc4eb482abd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f59a37440ab95ef90b5519bda697b22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad4c2dae4e12654bb3e81ead3541cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ce498c7ddd5c009a90ed486bcfceca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40b9d69bbf62abe14ff7f951a8f1b3dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f7453f64b9cfe580cad7fb2204da56d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33890bb7ed1971a8ca3baa37c919f6af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f72c84ae0acbd2472ea50de1b750541e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6fc09ed3694cfe56cf8f65ff5ee302c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96c42ede41c6ff4d6a78647f8a045bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-429754eb2ecdebc430531262f856dab5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280424</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="中泰证券股份有限公司">
      <data key="d0">中泰证券股份有限公司</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">中泰证券股份有限公司是本次发行的保荐人(主承销商)，负责承销股票并承担相关法律责任。&lt;SEP&gt;中泰证券股份有限公司是武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司本次发行的保荐人和主承销商。&lt;SEP&gt;中泰证券股份有限公司is the lead underwriter and sponsor for the IPO of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhongtai Securities Co., Ltd. is the sponsor (lead underwriter) for the initial public offering.&lt;SEP&gt;中泰证券股份有限公司is the sponsor institution and lead underwriter for the issuance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3bba9eac029b302aabf1571d3c8bb5ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4426fe3d656d20408ebd50181707d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39f27d5d5579801d1cdaf922634a9664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-264945d8604614fb2c3329d545303a62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec025d53a56038a876436730c19cdf15</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
