    <node id="补充流动资金">
      <data key="d0">补充流动资金</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">补充流动资金is a project to supplement working capital.&lt;SEP&gt;补充流动资金是武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司计划使用募集资金投资的项目之一，总投资额为15,000.00万元。&lt;SEP&gt;The use of raised funds to supplement working capital, with an amount of 15,000.00 yuan.&lt;SEP&gt;补充流动资金is a project to supplement working capital for the company.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cb54c5118e1ed95515ee7fc4eb482abd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74df7cf01c247ecef37cb477bc0fe0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ce498c7ddd5c009a90ed486bcfceca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b59dc9076db2d9449b88f11f20c42390</data>
