      <data key="d2">归属于母公司所有者权益is the equity attributable to the parent company's shareholders, such as 19,590.27万元as of June 30, 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;归属于母公司所有者权益is a financial data item representing equity attributable to the parent company, with values reported for multiple periods.</data>
