    <node id="资产负债率">
      <data key="d0">资产负债率</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">资产负债率is the debt-to-asset ratio of the parent company, such as 17.92% as of June 30, 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;资产负债率is a long-term solvency indicator, with values reported for武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司and peer companies from 2016 to 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;资产负债率is a long-term solvency indicator, calculated as total liabilities divided by total assets.&lt;SEP&gt;资产负债率是衡量公司财务杠杆的指标，报告期内公司资产负债率较低。&lt;SEP&gt;资产负债率是衡量公司负债水平的指标，超过70%时可不实施现金分红。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74df7cf01c247ecef37cb477bc0fe0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e656485b8e1232cecdf0a7abaa9ce5f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0716abb3520ec176e6192d2f96150520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c007f1fc740ba4fcb6bf207b57f3a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f3d7056e02a299ea6664597310ddb66</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280169</data>
