    <node id="基本每股收益">
      <data key="d0">基本每股收益</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">基本每股收益is the basic earnings per share, such as 0.01元for the first half of 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;基本每股收益是衡量每股盈利的指标，报告期内分别为0.09元/股、0.61元/股、0.79元/股和0.01元/股。&lt;SEP&gt;基本每股收益是衡量每股盈利能力的财务指标，发行人该指标在报告期内分别为0.09元/股、0.61元/股、0.79元/股和0.01元/股。&lt;SEP&gt;基本每股收益is a basic earnings per share figure reported in the financial statements.&lt;SEP&gt;基本每股收益is basic earnings per share, with values reported for 2016-2019.&lt;SEP&gt;基本每股收益is a financial metric representing basic earnings per share.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74df7cf01c247ecef37cb477bc0fe0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6218739cb192cff96f29ab446f3c5a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d9d0f08c60fc1566be4d59b80e3ce8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67c4855ed613e5a5fb6557e3b5e3f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85051b285f1c500763f83db7eb74a280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a409f0c18103033f1c4f6387ed11cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d51704377d2e3d78aa27e8138b398a4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
