    <node id="加权平均净资产收益率">
      <data key="d0">加权平均净资产收益率</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">加权平均净资产收益率is the weighted average return on equity, such as 0.36% for the first half of 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;加权平均净资产收益率是衡量公司盈利能力的指标，报告期内分别为5.16%、26.50%、24.50%和0.36%。&lt;SEP&gt;加权平均净资产收益率是衡量公司盈利能力的财务指标，发行人该指标在报告期内分别为5.16%、26.50%、24.50%和0.36%。&lt;SEP&gt;加权平均净资产收益率is the weighted average return on net assets, with values reported for 2016-2019.&lt;SEP&gt;加权平均净资产收益率is a financial metric representing the weighted average return on net assets.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74df7cf01c247ecef37cb477bc0fe0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6218739cb192cff96f29ab446f3c5a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d9d0f08c60fc1566be4d59b80e3ce8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85051b285f1c500763f83db7eb74a280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a409f0c18103033f1c4f6387ed11cd</data>
