    <node id="经营活动产生的现金流量净额">
      <data key="d0">经营活动产生的现金流量净额</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">经营活动产生的现金流量净额is the net cash flow from operating activities, such as -324.60万元for the first half of 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;经营活动产生的现金流量净额is a financial metric representing the net cash flow from operating activities, with values for 2016 to 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;经营活动产生的现金流量净额is the net cash flow generated from operating activities.&lt;SEP&gt;经营活动产生的现金流量净额is a financial metric representing net cash flow from operating activities.&lt;SEP&gt;经营活动产生的现金流量净额(Net Cash Flow from Operating Activities) is a financial metric with values -324.60, -291.47, 2,459.47, and -1,058.70.&lt;SEP&gt;经营活动产生的现金流量净额反映了公司日常经营活动的现金收支情况，部分期间为负值。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74df7cf01c247ecef37cb477bc0fe0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3cbd1cd4f955f7935adf7329e5d5b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e656485b8e1232cecdf0a7abaa9ce5f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0716abb3520ec176e6192d2f96150520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bebcff7a955f77172a16384e24aabab1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bdc3ef17a314565d7acb2ce2a958a2</data>
