    <node id="研发投入占营业收入的比例">
      <data key="d0">研发投入占营业收入的比例</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">研发投入占营业收入的比例is the ratio of R&amp;D investment to operating revenue, such as 30.84% for the first half of 2019.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e74df7cf01c247ecef37cb477bc0fe0f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
