    <node id="2018年度">
      <data key="d0">2018年度</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2018年度 is a fiscal year and reporting period corresponding to the calendar year 2018, used for presenting financial data, performance comparisons, and operational disclosures. It serves as the previous fiscal year for benchmarking a company's financial performance and is the period covered by financial statements, including the cash flow statements of 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司. During this reporting period, the company reported relatively high gross profit margins on products sold to 山东神沃 and 擎天讯达. The total procurement amount for labor and technical services was recorded at 312.79万元. Additionally, 2018年度 is the timeframe for which procurement data for various materials and services is reported, and it is the period subject to audit procedures, such as those involving the impairment testing of accounts receivable.

In terms of financial performance, 2018年度 saw the company's revenue grow by 33.12% year-over-year, while net profit remained stable relative to operating profit. The company also reported a stable operating cost structure. Interest expenses decreased by 67.64% compared to 2017, and a provision for decline in value of H.264 encoding equipment was made. Furthermore, during this fiscal year, revenue from video command and control products continued to grow, primarily driven by the extension of military informatization construction and demand for updates and replacements.&lt;SEP&gt;2018年度is a fiscal year for which the company provided financial data.&lt;SEP&gt;2018年度is a fiscal year referenced in the financial data, covering the year 2018.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2273ac3cd308f24a535921577d4315a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67c4855ed613e5a5fb6557e3b5e3f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3cbd1cd4f955f7935adf7329e5d5b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89b412cfc15b061e0a7f50978f8d7142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e343e9f8cca7465d3a833f634c92cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09841b91427b70d08c09d01179754ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f803e4453a24e458607776c5e60c8e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0a095e584ed3b2151ee03451073aae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85051b285f1c500763f83db7eb74a280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d012b93d8b658c8e32c326d8f1e487&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75655ab366b5c847fe0116fe140d77a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a409f0c18103033f1c4f6387ed11cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca1d4c6073e8fe4ca24324943967d75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e392bb86bc3233d11d6daf07ec661482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b659c02f075465fc5496f416010543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bebcff7a955f77172a16384e24aabab1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bdc3ef17a314565d7acb2ce2a958a2</data>
