    <node id="扣除非经常性损益后归属于母公司股东的净利润(2018年度)">
      <data key="d0">扣除非经常性损益后归属于母公司股东的净利润(2018年度)</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">扣除非经常性损益后归属于母公司股东的净利润(2018年度) is the net profit attributable to parent company shareholders after deducting non-recurring gains and losses for 2018, which was 4,015.90万元.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2273ac3cd308f24a535921577d4315a5</data>
