    <node id="国防信息化建设">
      <data key="d0">国防信息化建设</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">国防信息化建设is the concept of national defense informatization construction, which is a driving factor for the company's revenue growth.&lt;SEP&gt;国防信息化建设是推动公司收入增长的主要因素，随着其力度加强，公司预期收入规模扩大。&lt;SEP&gt;国防信息化建设refers to the national defense informatization construction, which has accelerated due to military reforms.&lt;SEP&gt;国防信息化建设is the concept of national defense informatization construction that drives product requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;国防信息化建设是推动公司收入恢复和增长的国家级战略方向。&lt;SEP&gt;国防信息化建设是推动公司2017年业务规模快速增长的因素之一。&lt;SEP&gt;国防信息化建设是推动公司视频指挥系统产品在军方部署的因素，促进了收入增长。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2273ac3cd308f24a535921577d4315a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0423780d8b9cfac69a906ddafd659e0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a268be32c2288ea8433062dd1b18f37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9d8506c960bd0285b9b0bf9389aba42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d51704377d2e3d78aa27e8138b398a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-713ce2985a5928404c7e469db525578d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acf02a504557f18cdbf2cc5a70e82348</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279718</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="2019年第三次临时股东大会">
      <data key="d0">2019年第三次临时股东大会</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The 2019年第三次临时股东大会 (the Third Extraordinary General Meeting of Shareholders in 2019) of 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 (Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd.) was a specific shareholders' meeting held on May 23, 2019. During this meeting, several key resolutions were approved. The meeting approved the distribution of accumulated undistributed profits and passed a resolution that the company's accumulated undistributed profits prior to its listing would be shared by both new and old shareholders. Additionally, the meeting reviewed and approved proposals confirming the company's related-party transactions from 2016 to 2018.

Furthermore, the 2019年第三次临时股东大会 approved a fundraising and investment plan, as well as the management system for raised funds. The meeting also approved the draft of the company's articles of association.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2273ac3cd308f24a535921577d4315a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ea770b7c76363fae7c405ea9d01af81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-296a72753256021351c386543f50f98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad4c2dae4e12654bb3e81ead3541cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-735c1e7025b476d06d2968a85d58fc1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ce498c7ddd5c009a90ed486bcfceca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b59dc9076db2d9449b88f11f20c42390&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6fc09ed3694cfe56cf8f65ff5ee302c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
