    <node id="2019年6月30日">
      <data key="d0">2019年6月30日</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2019年6月30日is the specific date of the financial report audit cut-off.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年6月30日is the end of the first half of fiscal year 2019, a reporting period for the company's financial data.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年6月30日is a reporting date for overdue receivables.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年6月30日is a reporting period end date for which the company disclosed accounts receivable data.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年6月30日is a reporting date for which accounts receivable data from civilian customers was disclosed.</data>
