    <node id="关联交易">
      <data key="d0">关联交易</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">关联交易refers to related-party transactions involving武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.&lt;SEP&gt;关联交易是公司与其关联方之间的交易，需遵循决策制度和回避表决制度以保证公允性。&lt;SEP&gt;关联交易refers to transactions between武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司and雷众科技, which are considered related-party transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;关联交易refers to related party transactions, which are regulated by the company's articles of association with specific approval thresholds and voting procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;关联交易是指公司与关联方之间发生的交易，需遵循特定的决策程序和信息披露要求。&lt;SEP&gt;关联交易是指公司与控股股东、实际控制人及其控制的其他企业之间发生的交易。&lt;SEP&gt;关联交易refers to related-party transactions that the company commits to regulate and minimize.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cd0253c8fd4cf1a734f1e20c69452e83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f944c8f4f3100f826c0cf74b0febe515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-296a72753256021351c386543f50f98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebce0fbc7929f451f894a801d9e061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-300a7f00696488d0691b1bffb9611757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-429754eb2ecdebc430531262f856dab5</data>
