    <node id="股东">
      <data key="d0">股东</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">股东are the shareholders of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, including the controlling shareholder and other major shareholders.&lt;SEP&gt;股东are holders of the company's shares who have rights to dividends and participation in corporate governance.&lt;SEP&gt;股东是公司的所有者，按照持有的股份比例分配剩余税后利润。&lt;SEP&gt;股东是公司的所有者，有权参加股东大会并通过网络或其他方式行使投票权。&lt;SEP&gt;股东are shareholders of the company who are entitled to apologies and compensation for losses caused by unfulfilled commitments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cd0253c8fd4cf1a734f1e20c69452e83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-735c1e7025b476d06d2968a85d58fc1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c007f1fc740ba4fcb6bf207b57f3a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63e5d2afa2bb086b998b098937fd536f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33890bb7ed1971a8ca3baa37c919f6af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96c42ede41c6ff4d6a78647f8a045bc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280442</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="董事">
      <data key="d0">董事</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">董事are the members of the board of directors of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.&lt;SEP&gt;董事refers to the directors of the company, excluding independent directors and those not receiving compensation, who are involved in share price stabilization measures.&lt;SEP&gt;董事是公司的高级管理人员，在特定条件下有义务增持公司股票以稳定股价。&lt;SEP&gt;董事是公司治理结构中的成员，就公司填补回报措施作出了相关承诺。&lt;SEP&gt;董事是公司治理结构中的成员，承诺招股意向书及其他信息披露资料的真实性、准确性和完整性。&lt;SEP&gt;董事are directors of the company who have made commitments regarding the fulfillment of public promises.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cd0253c8fd4cf1a734f1e20c69452e83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0233c72dd0d594d28f50bc3b23148a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2418430c4d63d444240019e825101c4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ac79bf5c8fd0e1655f57c0fdc3c54fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33890bb7ed1971a8ca3baa37c919f6af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f72c84ae0acbd2472ea50de1b750541e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96c42ede41c6ff4d6a78647f8a045bc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280442</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="监事">
      <data key="d0">监事</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">监事are the members of the supervisory board of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.&lt;SEP&gt;监事是公司监督机构成员，承诺招股意向书及其他信息披露资料的真实性、准确性和完整性。&lt;SEP&gt;监事are supervisors of the company who have made commitments regarding the fulfillment of public promises.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cd0253c8fd4cf1a734f1e20c69452e83&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0233c72dd0d594d28f50bc3b23148a73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33890bb7ed1971a8ca3baa37c919f6af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96c42ede41c6ff4d6a78647f8a045bc</data>
