    <node id="国防和军队改革">
      <data key="d0">国防和军队改革</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">国防和军队改革refers to national defense and military reforms that deepened from 2017 onwards, driving growth in contracts and revenue.&lt;SEP&gt;国防和军队改革是2016年开始的改革，按照“军委管总、战区主战、军种主建”原则进行，影响了军队客户的采购需求。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5876c16db338055a4b093d71d08df2e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f076d85db2467f92db8296b25952dd82</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780278577</data>
