      <data key="d2">Supply constraints are supporting the rally in crude oil prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Supply constraints are a factor supporting the rise in crude oil prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Supply constraints are a key factor supporting the rally in crude oil prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Supply constraints support the rally in crude oil prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Supply constraints are supporting the rise in crude oil prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Supply constraints are a factor supporting the rally in crude oil prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Crude oil prices continued their rally, climbing to $87.60 per barrel, supported by supply constraints and strong demand.</data>
