    <node id="孔繁东">
      <data key="d0">孔繁东</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">孔繁东是武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司（简称“兴图新科”）的副总经理，同时也是该公司的核心技术人员之一。他拥有江苏大学计算机软件专业的本科学历，具备软件工程与产品管理背景，曾担任公司产品副总工程师，后升任副总经理。孔繁东在兴图新科专职领薪，2018年的报酬总额为43.51万元。作为公司高级管理人员，他的职位保持稳定，未发生变动。此外，孔繁东还持有公司间接股份，并作为股东持有兴图投资（Xingtu Investment）3.18%的股份，显示出其与公司及关联投资实体之间的紧密利益关联。&lt;SEP&gt;孔繁东is a main participant in the development of several core technologies including高可靠、高并发、大容量的视音频中间件技术, 复杂环境网络适应技术, and超低延时编解码技术.&lt;SEP&gt;孔繁东是与相关技术或系统相关的人员。&lt;SEP&gt;孔繁东is the deputy general manager of the company, responsible for organizing the development of systems, terminals, and equipment, building the core technical team, and contributing to the architecture, design, and development of audio and video middleware and hardware products.&lt;SEP&gt;孔繁东is one of the 30 key employees who received shares from程家明.&lt;SEP&gt;孔繁东is a senior manager and core technical personnel of the company who indirectly holds company shares and has made lock-up commitments.&lt;SEP&gt;孔繁东is a senior management member of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-4bd3436d1202e13a5f4ad72edab05da5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a74f670aa8d3f35400a2e46d0a88fdb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8206957ceb85ffe01f41376b51df1aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395c544cbdbc0fb5c7f956be865084b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7e15bacdff9b9dbac1e607320b745d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-509b7e822bffbfde184be47ea8af2501&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2faeec762f48630cc3f1c9539369a799&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c91e5a09e5b0bcbc71fef843955ccfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b84096a6e6d9f55493f1531e413c38d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-654210e4a83c095d604993852216dccb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58b70a42920a91dffdca8121d66a66eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4349106fc8c4504c29d0d6d6070b103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11fab67a60a21371f8a33b4f435c8355&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5af88a45916f0db4a042242b4f213402</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
