    <node id="公司章程">
      <data key="d0">公司章程</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The company's articles of association, which govern the changes in directors, supervisors, and senior management.&lt;SEP&gt;《公司章程》是公司治理的基本文件，规定了薪酬与考核委员会的职责和薪酬方案的考评程序。&lt;SEP&gt;公司章程is the company's articles of association.&lt;SEP&gt;公司章程is the company's charter that defines its governance structure and rules.&lt;SEP&gt;公司章程是公司的内部规章，公司严格按照其要求规范运作。&lt;SEP&gt;公司章程is the company's articles of association that define the authority of the shareholders' meeting and the board of directors regarding related party transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;公司章程是公司内部治理的基本文件，规定了股东大会召开、投票权征集等事项。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a74f670aa8d3f35400a2e46d0a88fdb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395c544cbdbc0fb5c7f956be865084b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ea770b7c76363fae7c405ea9d01af81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5c0c72057a06111028608a0973aef2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebce0fbc7929f451f894a801d9e061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63e5d2afa2bb086b998b098937fd536f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280209</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
