    <node id="投资协议书">
      <data key="d0">投资协议书</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">投资协议书是公司与光谷人才创投签署的关于投资事宜的协议。&lt;SEP&gt;The original Investment Agreement between the company, 程家明, and the investment entities.&lt;SEP&gt;投资协议书is the primary investment agreement outlining the terms of investment between the parties.&lt;SEP&gt;投资协议书is the investment agreement between武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司and the investors, outlining terms and conditions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a09b6bc54fb44efe4b7c53573963ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25bb161f5a3eed908ebf574181f3cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8720e7aa67adb2980b4973af48e4b91b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf933ea6ad543d32c5edbe9d972ca701</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
