    </node>
    <node id="天健会计师事务所(特殊普通合伙)湖南分所">
      <data key="d0">天健会计师事务所(特殊普通合伙)湖南分所</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">天健会计师事务所(特殊普通合伙)湖南分所是负责对本次增资进行审验的会计师事务所。&lt;SEP&gt;天健会计师事务所(特殊普通合伙)湖南分所是负责对本次增资进行审验并出具验资报告的审计机构。&lt;SEP&gt;Tianjian Accounting Firm (Special General Partnership) Hunan Branch, which verified the capital increase and issued a capital verification report.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a09b6bc54fb44efe4b7c53573963ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25bb161f5a3eed908ebf574181f3cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16dbba47d97c65bf8e82845fca5a61d7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780275791</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="验资报告">
      <data key="d0">验资报告</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">验资报告是北京中证天通会计师事务所有限公司于2011年1月19日出具的文件，确认公司已收到全体股东缴纳的注册资本1,800.00万元。&lt;SEP&gt;《验资报告》由武汉莲城会计师事务所有限公司出具，确认了公司设立时的出资情况。&lt;SEP&gt;The capital verification report issued by Tianjian Accounting Firm, confirming the receipt of capital contributions.&lt;SEP&gt;The capital verification reports (Tianjian Xiang Yan [2017] 19, Tianjian Xiang Yan [2017] 32, Tianjian Xiang Yan [2018] 27) are documents issued by the accounting firm.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a09b6bc54fb44efe4b7c53573963ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16dbba47d97c65bf8e82845fca5a61d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba9e539e2a95244b725131333cf02b15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec025d53a56038a876436730c19cdf15</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280457</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="武汉工商局">
      <data key="d0">武汉工商局</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">武汉工商局是负责办理公司工商变更登记手续的政府机构。&lt;SEP&gt;Wuhan Administration for Industry and Commerce, where the company registered the business changes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a09b6bc54fb44efe4b7c53573963ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25bb161f5a3eed908ebf574181f3cc8</data>
