    <node id="汇智蓝健">
      <data key="d0">汇智蓝健</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">汇智蓝健is an investment fund that acquired shares from程家明in 2017.&lt;SEP&gt;Huizhi Lanjian is a shareholder of the company.&lt;SEP&gt;汇智蓝健is a shareholder of the issuer, holding 4.35% of shares before the issuance.&lt;SEP&gt;汇智蓝健is a limited partnership in which杜成城is a limited partner with a 20% capital contribution, directly holding 4.35% equity in the company.&lt;SEP&gt;汇智蓝健is a shareholder holding less than 5% of shares before the issuance and has made commitments regarding share lock-up.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a09b6bc54fb44efe4b7c53573963ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-990274235a3a49eed4cdcbefe01ab063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da0b72f01e2d9bde007a3a87db2ecf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d87bc8720f0c140e823bbd72c42ba464&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab4bf4932d168a325f6494b1024eab4b</data>
