    <node id="杜成城">
      <data key="d0">杜成城</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">杜成城is a person who acquired shares from华汇创投in 2018 and received cash compensation.&lt;SEP&gt;杜成城is a shareholder of the company.&lt;SEP&gt;杜成城is a natural person shareholder of the issuer, holding 2.72% of shares before the issuance.&lt;SEP&gt;杜成城is a male Chinese national, born in February 1966, with a college degree. He is a new shareholder of the issuer and has a background as a teacher and entrepreneur, founding multiple companies including汕头万顺包装材料股份有限公司.&lt;SEP&gt;杜成城is an individual who acquired shares from武汉华汇创业投资基金合伙企业(有限合伙).&lt;SEP&gt;杜成城is a shareholder holding less than 5% of shares before the issuance and has made commitments regarding share lock-up.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a09b6bc54fb44efe4b7c53573963ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-990274235a3a49eed4cdcbefe01ab063&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da0b72f01e2d9bde007a3a87db2ecf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d87bc8720f0c140e823bbd72c42ba464&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4349106fc8c4504c29d0d6d6070b103&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab4bf4932d168a325f6494b1024eab4b</data>
