      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">王智勇是武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司的发起人，持股18.00万股，持股比例1.00%。&lt;SEP&gt;王智勇是武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司的股东。&lt;SEP&gt;王智勇is a shareholder of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.&lt;SEP&gt;王智勇is a shareholder of the company.&lt;SEP&gt;王智勇is a natural person shareholder of the issuer, holding 0.50% of shares before the issuance.&lt;SEP&gt;王智勇is a person mentioned in the context of shareholding data, associated with specific numerical values.&lt;SEP&gt;王智勇is a shareholder holding less than 5% of shares before the issuance and has made commitments regarding share lock-up.</data>
