    <node id="雷娟">
      <data key="d0">雷娟</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">雷娟is a shareholder of Xingtu Investment with a 0.71% stake, and serves as the Personnel Supervisor of the issuer.&lt;SEP&gt;雷娟is a person who was nominated and elected as a shareholder representative supervisor at武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.&lt;SEP&gt;雷娟was a supervisor of the issuer who resigned due to personal reasons and later became the Personnel Director.&lt;SEP&gt;雷娟是公司最近12个月内任监事，其配偶雷本良控制雷众科技。</data>
