    <node id="编解码阵列">
      <data key="d0">编解码阵列</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">编解码阵列是兴图新科生产的核心硬件之一，用于编解码处理。&lt;SEP&gt;编解码阵列是机架式设备，部署在机柜，具备视音频编码、数据封装、数据解封、视音频解码和视音频播放能力。&lt;SEP&gt;编解码阵列is a coding and decoding array with a five-year warranty.&lt;SEP&gt;编解码阵列is a specific R&amp;D project with recorded costs in 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;编解码阵列is a product with R&amp;D expenses applied for tax deductions in 2019.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7a439299f90cd269df576a65e3aec0bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d373540c8eeaa2735aface7c899501&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5288680441cccde546f63a3d07640e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-670aa3ebf08c631aa296139c61a19e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-225fc50e812ba7666027f5c412481f15</data>
