      <data key="d0">公司法</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Company Law of China, which governs the changes in directors, supervisors, and senior management.&lt;SEP&gt;公司法is the Company Law of China, which the company follows.&lt;SEP&gt;公司法is a law that governs the establishment and operation of companies.&lt;SEP&gt;公司法是中国关于公司组织和行为的法律，公司严格按照其要求规范运作。&lt;SEP&gt;公司法是与公司信息披露相关的法律之一。&lt;SEP&gt;The公司法is a legal document that governs the establishment and operation of companies in China.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-395c544cbdbc0fb5c7f956be865084b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ea770b7c76363fae7c405ea9d01af81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5c0c72057a06111028608a0973aef2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-735c1e7025b476d06d2968a85d58fc1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7697975eabd8b002d862220e58afb1a8</data>
