    <node id="董事会">
      <data key="d0">董事会</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">董事会是武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司的董事会（Board of Directors），是该公司的治理机构与决策机构。董事会依照《中华人民共和国公司法》及《公司章程》等规定设置，负责公司的重大决策与执行职能。具体而言，董事会负责提名董事，批准会计政策变更，并有权公开征集股东投票权。在关联交易管理方面，董事会负责审议批准相关关联交易事项，并授权经营管理层处理特定金额范围内的关联交易。此外，董事会还负责拟定利润分配方案及调整利润分配政策的议案，提出利润分配具体方案，并将相关议案提交股东大会审议。作为公司的执行机构与决策机构，董事会在公司治理结构中发挥着核心作用。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fc982eece00e588340b45e4d5d4a2085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73018cc88f63622273f2f8654c27d498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ea770b7c76363fae7c405ea9d01af81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-296a72753256021351c386543f50f98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebce0fbc7929f451f894a801d9e061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a43fca9e573d5142853f858f459e3659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad4c2dae4e12654bb3e81ead3541cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c007f1fc740ba4fcb6bf207b57f3a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63e5d2afa2bb086b998b098937fd536f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280162</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="股东大会">
      <data key="d0">股东大会</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The general meeting of shareholders, known as "股东大会," is the highest authority and power institution of a company. It is established in accordance with the Company Law and the company's articles of association. For 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, this meeting serves as the supreme governing body. The 股东大会 is responsible for approving significant related party transactions and guarantees, and it specifically reviews related party transaction proposals, handling them when there are fewer than three unrelated directors. It also deliberates and approves profit distribution plans and any adjustments to profit distribution policies. The meeting is convened in the form of an on-site session, while also providing online or other methods to facilitate shareholder participation.&lt;SEP&gt;股东大会是公司最高权力机构，涉及股东决策和公司治理。&lt;SEP&gt;股东大会is a corporate event where shareholders vote and the company discloses information.&lt;SEP&gt;股东大会is the shareholders' general meeting where unfulfilled commitments are publicly explained.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fc982eece00e588340b45e4d5d4a2085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ea770b7c76363fae7c405ea9d01af81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-296a72753256021351c386543f50f98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22ebce0fbc7929f451f894a801d9e061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad4c2dae4e12654bb3e81ead3541cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c007f1fc740ba4fcb6bf207b57f3a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63e5d2afa2bb086b998b098937fd536f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33890bb7ed1971a8ca3baa37c919f6af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96c42ede41c6ff4d6a78647f8a045bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-429754eb2ecdebc430531262f856dab5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280450</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="智能安全帽产品">
      <data key="d0">智能安全帽产品</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">智能安全帽产品是兴图天建研发、生产与销售的产品，业务尚处于前期投入阶段。&lt;SEP&gt;智能安全帽产品is a specific R&amp;D project with recorded costs in 2016, 2017, and 2018.&lt;SEP&gt;智能安全帽产品is a civilian product developed by the company, with R&amp;D expenses applied for tax deductions in 2016.</data>
