    <node id="微型投影仪">
      <data key="d0">微型投影仪</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">微型投影仪是武汉启目的主营业务产品，其生产及销售是发行人主营业务组成部分。&lt;SEP&gt;微型投影仪是公司销售的民品产品之一，用于投影显示。&lt;SEP&gt;微型投影仪是公司产品所需的原材料之一，采购金额在报告期内有较大波动。&lt;SEP&gt;微型投影仪are micro projectors procured by the company, with volatile procurement due to market entry and product upgrades.&lt;SEP&gt;微型投影仪is a category of micro projectors procured by the company, with procurement data listed for various years.&lt;SEP&gt;微型投影仪is a product sold by the company in 2017, which led to higher labor costs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-87007ed5a3bb427e290e32a0b22cdeb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da8fc31188e449d6106dadda0587623f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09841b91427b70d08c09d01179754ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f803e4453a24e458607776c5e60c8e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff7549276f1a5851e3d0960ead6ac02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b659c02f075465fc5496f416010543</data>
