      <data key="d0">直接军方客户</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">直接军方客户are direct military customers that purchase from the company through bidding or single-source procurement.&lt;SEP&gt;直接军方客户refers to direct military customers, where the company sells directly to military units.&lt;SEP&gt;直接军方客户是指公司直接与军方用户合作，承担整套视频指挥控制系统建设任务，包括核心产品和外部采购配套设备。&lt;SEP&gt;直接军方客户are direct military customers whose settlement policy is based on acceptance, with payment cycles typically long due to military approval and fund allocation processes.&lt;SEP&gt;直接军方客户refers to direct military clients of the company, whose accounts receivable balances and aging are analyzed in the prospectus.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d83bd67a4ed736ec4aa2ca49a9dd3ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a268be32c2288ea8433062dd1b18f37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b333deb5f5e35e59ac493bf57bf26c8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccbca840e9b72177073f20adad793e2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d85045625dc6dfb91844c0426117918a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279670</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="间接军方客户">
      <data key="d0">间接军方客户</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">间接军方客户are indirect military customers, including overall units (public institutions) and integrators (corporate legal persons), who primarily purchase through direct procurement.&lt;SEP&gt;间接军方客户refers to indirect military customers, where the company sells through integrators rather than directly to the military.&lt;SEP&gt;间接军方客户是指通过集成单位与军方合作的客户，公司向其销售核心系统产品，毛利率较高。&lt;SEP&gt;间接军方客户are indirect military customers, including overall units and integration units, with varying settlement policies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d83bd67a4ed736ec4aa2ca49a9dd3ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a268be32c2288ea8433062dd1b18f37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b333deb5f5e35e59ac493bf57bf26c8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccbca840e9b72177073f20adad793e2f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279670</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="公开招标">
      <data key="d0">公开招标</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">公开招标是兴图新科获取客户订单的一种方式，通过公开竞争获取项目。&lt;SEP&gt;公开招标is a procurement method involving public bidding for selecting suppliers.&lt;SEP&gt;公开招标is a competitive order acquisition method involving public bidding, used for direct military and prison system customers.&lt;SEP&gt;公开招标is a public bidding process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d83bd67a4ed736ec4aa2ca49a9dd3ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d373540c8eeaa2735aface7c899501&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e6ef010bba2a819545e29f981f9a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99b50c91999c3bd07c0062342808aba</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780278563</data>
