    <node id="竞争性谈判">
      <data key="d0">竞争性谈判</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">竞争性谈判是兴图新科获取客户订单的一种方式，通过谈判获取项目。&lt;SEP&gt;竞争性谈判is a procurement method involving competitive negotiations.&lt;SEP&gt;竞争性谈判is a competitive order acquisition method similar to public bidding, used for negotiating prices with customers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d83bd67a4ed736ec4aa2ca49a9dd3ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d373540c8eeaa2735aface7c899501&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e6ef010bba2a819545e29f981f9a6a</data>
