    <node id="询价">
      <data key="d0">询价</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">询价是兴图新科获取客户订单的一种方式，通过询价获取项目。&lt;SEP&gt;询价is a procurement method involving price inquiries.&lt;SEP&gt;询价is an order acquisition method for small-value, highly standardized purchases with stable prices.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d83bd67a4ed736ec4aa2ca49a9dd3ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d373540c8eeaa2735aface7c899501&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e6ef010bba2a819545e29f981f9a6a</data>
