    </node>
    <node id="直接采购">
      <data key="d0">直接采购</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">直接采购是兴图新科获取客户订单的一种方式，直接向客户采购。&lt;SEP&gt;直接采购is a procurement method involving direct purchase without bidding.&lt;SEP&gt;直接采购is a direct procurement method used by indirect military customers, involving many small-value contracts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d83bd67a4ed736ec4aa2ca49a9dd3ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30d373540c8eeaa2735aface7c899501&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e6ef010bba2a819545e29f981f9a6a</data>
