      <data key="d0">协议采购</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">协议采购is an order acquisition method covering indirect military customers and civilian products.&lt;SEP&gt;协议采购是公司获取订单的一种方式，涵盖间接军方(总体单位、集成商)及民品各类型客户。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d83bd67a4ed736ec4aa2ca49a9dd3ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e40d83cbd381962ff45bb45124711c1</data>
