    <node id="产品生产成本">
      <data key="d0">产品生产成本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">产品生产成本includes material costs and labor costs, which are a basis for pricing.&lt;SEP&gt;产品生产成本includes direct materials and direct labor costs incurred during production.&lt;SEP&gt;产品生产成本包括直接材料和直接人工，是生产过程中发生的成本。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d83bd67a4ed736ec4aa2ca49a9dd3ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68fc75e0518c7a7c27f8e04edf36f2d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b25c1709d3d8634e2bf9aa86a05beec5</data>
