      <data key="d0">自产产品</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">自产产品是发行人自行生产的产品，由生产部负责生产。&lt;SEP&gt;自产产品refers to self-produced products within the video command control and video warning control categories.&lt;SEP&gt;自产产品refers to self-produced products, which are a category of material costs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0099d5a68aa2a54c0a612a238ad5ba37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24d2a0eeb5394c1bb2920dce48699105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be0da8d1f5fb8afb0f6838ed3366b2db</data>
