    <node id="Quarterly Earnings">
      <data key="d0">Quarterly Earnings</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Quarterly earnings are financial reports that reflect a company's performance over a three-month period.&lt;SEP&gt;Nexon Technologies reported lower-than-expected quarterly earnings, leading to a stock decline.&lt;SEP&gt;Quarterly earnings are financial reports that, when lower than expected, can lead to stock declines like that of Nexon Technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Quarterly earnings are financial reports that Nexon Technologies released, which were lower than expected.&lt;SEP&gt;Quarterly earnings are financial reports that Nexon Technologies released, which were lower than expected and caused its stock to plummet.&lt;SEP&gt;Quarterly earnings are financial reports that companies release, and Nexon Technologies reported lower-than-expected results.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-35d5ae0cd3bef83c69a9a04359fd3085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2be25df1af7e30c6a7392305cb22b52d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f944c8f4f3100f826c0cf74b0febe515&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8b769f0b1dab26f09748ff9020c177a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7c33a304af0ab2f99ea0a8298e156a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40b9d69bbf62abe14ff7f951a8f1b3dd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280214</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="编解码卡">
      <data key="d0">编解码卡</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">编解码卡是从外部采购的组件，公司通过烧录自研算法后插入矩阵机箱形成编解码矩阵。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-88b3d1c3a20dfbb1aa241c83ed13bf48</data>
