    </node>
    <node id="总体单位A">
      <data key="d0">总体单位A</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">总体单位A is a specific overall unit that procures products from the company as specified by users.&lt;SEP&gt;总体单位A是公司产品的指定采购方之一，通过单一来源采购方式采购公司产品。&lt;SEP&gt;总体单位A is the main contractor involved in a two-factory-four-party contract with the company.&lt;SEP&gt;总体单位A is a long-term cooperative entity that owes money to武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-41e6ef010bba2a819545e29f981f9a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e40d83cbd381962ff45bb45124711c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68fc75e0518c7a7c27f8e04edf36f2d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43</data>
