      <data key="d2">总体单位D is a specific overall unit that procures products from the company as specified by users.&lt;SEP&gt;总体单位D是公司产品的指定采购方之一，通过单一来源采购方式采购公司产品。&lt;SEP&gt;总体单位D is a long-term cooperative entity that owes money to武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司.</data>
