    <node id="应收账款账龄">
      <data key="d0">应收账款账龄</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">应收账款账龄是反映应收账款从形成到报告期末的时间长度，用于评估回款风险。&lt;SEP&gt;应收账款账龄is the aging of accounts receivable, categorized by time periods such as 1 year or less, 1-2 years, etc.&lt;SEP&gt;应收账款账龄is the aging of accounts receivable, indicating how long invoices have been outstanding.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e827ebe778b4fe39c952a40be61f9bc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25d86c858ab99da23adbe0a6a1090d48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93fb79958d661926096c59442d227d57</data>
