    <node id="民品客户">
      <data key="d0">民品客户</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">民品客户包括监狱系统客户、监狱系统集成商、保险公司及油田客户等，公司基于生产成本等因素与客户谈判确定价格。&lt;SEP&gt;民品客户refers to civilian customers who purchase the company's products.&lt;SEP&gt;民品客户是公司的民用产品客户，其销售收入占主营业务收入比重较小，毛利率波动较大。&lt;SEP&gt;民品客户are civilian customers who purchase products from the company, often for projects like prison monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;民品客户refers to civilian product customers.&lt;SEP&gt;民品客户are civilian customers of the company, whose sales scale and collection speed have declined over the reporting period.</data>
