    <node id="其他应收款">
      <data key="d0">其他应收款</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Other receivables, a current asset item on the balance sheet, with amounts listed for various dates.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应收款is a financial data item representing other receivables, with values reported for multiple periods.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应收款是公司按组合评估预期信用风险和计量预期信用损失的金融工具之一。&lt;SEP&gt;其他应收款是公司应收款项的一种，其坏账准备计提比例根据账龄不同而变化。&lt;SEP&gt;其他应收款is other receivables, for which a bad debt provision of 31,200 yuan was made in the first half of 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应收款represents other receivables, with amounts of 142.73万元, 139.24万元, 111.33万元, and 154.34万元at the end of each period.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应收款refers to other receivables, for which the company applies a bad debt provision policy consistent with accounts receivable.</data>
