    <node id="长期待摊费用">
      <data key="d0">长期待摊费用</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Long-term deferred expenses, a non-current asset item on the balance sheet, with amounts listed for various dates.&lt;SEP&gt;长期待摊费用is a financial data item representing long-term deferred expenses, with values reported for multiple periods.&lt;SEP&gt;长期待摊费用核算已经支出、摊销期限在1年以上的各项费用，按实际发生额入账，在受益期或规定期限内分期平均摊销。&lt;SEP&gt;长期待摊费用are long-term deferred expenses included in the company's non-current assets.&lt;SEP&gt;长期待摊费用is a long-term deferred expense account including costs such as mold fees for smart safety helmet products and car rental fees for华创兴图.</data>
