      <data key="d0">递延所得税资产</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Deferred tax assets, a non-current asset item on the balance sheet, with amounts listed for various dates.&lt;SEP&gt;递延所得税资产is a financial data item representing deferred tax assets, with values reported for multiple periods.&lt;SEP&gt;递延所得税资产是公司财务报表中的项目，受应收票据坏账准备计提政策变更影响。&lt;SEP&gt;递延所得税资产is a balance sheet item representing deferred tax assets, with adjusted amounts of 4,676,401.28元in 2019 and 2,386,827.41元in 2016.&lt;SEP&gt;递延所得税资产is an accounting concept representing deferred tax assets.&lt;SEP&gt;递延所得税资产are deferred tax assets, part of the company's non-current assets.&lt;SEP&gt;递延所得税资产is a deferred tax asset primarily arising from deductible temporary differences due to bad debt provisions and inventory write-down provisions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-198fa18d52f19aa670d3f722b2c8773b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-507e2b6ca2f473187fea2747ef444ec5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a754cb39a70a7b6942e8d85cc566af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a7d8a8f50f4153ffa81ab184218607&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8bca8da2081d34328a41b4a7e5e979d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eee2c091e44ba62cc1d372bad97085a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8176626e00ddc22142d6204442ab4426</data>
