      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Short-term borrowings, a current liability item on the balance sheet, with amounts listed for various dates.&lt;SEP&gt;短期借款is a financial data item representing short-term borrowings, with values reported for multiple periods.&lt;SEP&gt;短期借款is a short-term borrowing component of current liabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;短期借款refers to short-term borrowings, with balances of 3,600.00, 1,500.00, 1,500.00, and 2,500.00 (in 10,000 yuan) at the end of each reporting period.&lt;SEP&gt;短期借款是武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司从银行获得的用于资金周转的借款，用于归还关联方拆入资金。</data>
