      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Other payables, a current liability item on the balance sheet, with amounts listed for various dates.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应付款is a financial data item representing other payables, with values reported for multiple periods.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应付款is a liability account item that was adjusted in the 2017 financial statements.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应付款refers to other payables, with balances of 538.92, 2,753.79, 92.79, and 63.06 (in 10,000 yuan) at the end of each reporting period.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应付款refers to other payables, a liability for miscellaneous amounts owed.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应付款is an accounting term for other payables, used to record the investment funds received as a financial liability.&lt;SEP&gt;其他应付款is a liability account used to record temporary payables to investors before formal capital confirmation.</data>
