    <node id="2016年度">
      <data key="d0">2016年度</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2016年度 is a fiscal year and reporting period that corresponds to the calendar year 2016. It serves as a standard timeframe for presenting financial data, statements, and operational metrics for various companies, including 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 (Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd.). During this period, the company reported annual revenue and disclosed specific procurement amounts, including a figure of 14.05万元 (140,500 RMB) for labor and technical service procurement. The financial data for 2016年度 indicates that project implementation costs accounted for a higher proportion of expenses, while project research and development (R&amp;D) costs were lower. Additionally, the gross profit margin for video warning and control products was relatively high during this period.

The fiscal year 2016年度 was significantly impacted by military reforms (军改), which led to a decrease in military procurement. This reduction in procurement caused a substantial decline in the company's revenue, particularly from video command and control products. As a result, the company experienced an abnormally high period expense ratio, and its operating profit was lower than its net profit. Overall, 2016年度 is consistently referenced across multiple contexts as a standard fiscal year for which comprehensive financial and operational data are reported and analyzed, with the noted challenges stemming from external factors such as military reforms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d67c4855ed613e5a5fb6557e3b5e3f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3cbd1cd4f955f7935adf7329e5d5b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89b412cfc15b061e0a7f50978f8d7142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09841b91427b70d08c09d01179754ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0a095e584ed3b2151ee03451073aae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85051b285f1c500763f83db7eb74a280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d012b93d8b658c8e32c326d8f1e487&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75655ab366b5c847fe0116fe140d77a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a409f0c18103033f1c4f6387ed11cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca1d4c6073e8fe4ca24324943967d75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e392bb86bc3233d11d6daf07ec661482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b659c02f075465fc5496f416010543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f0231c0a169dbc382fc93548d8e966b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bebcff7a955f77172a16384e24aabab1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bdc3ef17a314565d7acb2ce2a958a2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
