    <node id="2017年度">
      <data key="d0">2017年度</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2017年度 is a fiscal year and reporting period that corresponds to the calendar year 2017. It serves as a key timeframe for financial reporting, analysis, and the presentation of operational results. During this period, companies such as 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 prepared financial statements, including cash flow statements, and underwent financial report audits that involved procedures like impairment testing of accounts receivable. The company reported specific procurement data, such as 160.70万元 (1.607 million yuan) for labor and technical service procurement. Additionally, 2017年度 was marked by a recovery in revenue from video command and control products, driven by the strengthening of military informatization construction.

Within this fiscal year, the company experienced notable financial trends. Self-manufactured product material costs were lower due to large equipment maintenance contracts, while labor costs were higher because of micro-projector sales. The gross profit margin for video command and control products was relatively low during this period. Furthermore, the Ministry of Finance revised the accounting standard for government grants, leading the company to recognize government grants related to daily activities as other income. Overall, 2017年度 saw the company’s revenue grow by 87.10% year-over-year, with net profit remaining stable relative to operating profit. This fiscal year is consistently referenced as the fiscal year 2017, providing a comprehensive basis for evaluating the company’s annual financial performance and operational activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d67c4855ed613e5a5fb6557e3b5e3f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3cbd1cd4f955f7935adf7329e5d5b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89b412cfc15b061e0a7f50978f8d7142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e343e9f8cca7465d3a833f634c92cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09841b91427b70d08c09d01179754ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0a095e584ed3b2151ee03451073aae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85051b285f1c500763f83db7eb74a280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d012b93d8b658c8e32c326d8f1e487&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75655ab366b5c847fe0116fe140d77a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a409f0c18103033f1c4f6387ed11cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca1d4c6073e8fe4ca24324943967d75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e392bb86bc3233d11d6daf07ec661482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b659c02f075465fc5496f416010543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f0231c0a169dbc382fc93548d8e966b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bebcff7a955f77172a16384e24aabab1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bdc3ef17a314565d7acb2ce2a958a2</data>
