    <node id="2019年1-6月">
      <data key="d0">2019年1-6月</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2019年1-6月 is a reporting period that covers the first half of 2019, specifically from January to June 2019. This six-month period is used for presenting the financial data of a company, including its financial statements and cash flow statements. For 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, this period serves as a fiscal period for which various financial and procurement data are reported.

During this reporting period, the company reported total operating revenue of 4,905.65万元. The period also saw an increase in revenue from video command and control products compared to the same period in 2018, which was attributed to the early placement of orders influenced by major commemorative events. Additionally, the company reported procurement amounts for labor and technical services totaling 149.53万元. The period is also referenced for reporting procurement data for various materials and services, as well as for analyzing the company's revenue composition.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年1-6月is a time period representing the first half of 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年1-6月is a reporting period during which the company recognized a credit impairment loss of 2.1756 million yuan.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年1-6月is a fiscal period in which the company's revenue grew by 13.46% year-over-year, and net profit was 58.27% of operating profit.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年1-6月is a reporting period for which the company provided financial data.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d67c4855ed613e5a5fb6557e3b5e3f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3cbd1cd4f955f7935adf7329e5d5b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89b412cfc15b061e0a7f50978f8d7142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09841b91427b70d08c09d01179754ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0a095e584ed3b2151ee03451073aae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85051b285f1c500763f83db7eb74a280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d012b93d8b658c8e32c326d8f1e487&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75655ab366b5c847fe0116fe140d77a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a409f0c18103033f1c4f6387ed11cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca1d4c6073e8fe4ca24324943967d75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-713ce2985a5928404c7e469db525578d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e392bb86bc3233d11d6daf07ec661482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bebcff7a955f77172a16384e24aabab1</data>
