    <node id="证券法">
      <data key="d0">证券法</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">证券法is the Securities Law of China, which the company follows.&lt;SEP&gt;证券法is a law that regulates securities markets and related activities.&lt;SEP&gt;证券法是中国关于证券发行和交易的法律，公司严格按照其要求规范运作。&lt;SEP&gt;证券法是与公司信息披露相关的法律之一。&lt;SEP&gt;The证券法is a legal document that regulates securities issuance and trading in China.&lt;SEP&gt;证券法is the securities law that governs investor compensation and liability in cases of false statements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8ea770b7c76363fae7c405ea9d01af81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5c0c72057a06111028608a0973aef2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-735c1e7025b476d06d2968a85d58fc1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7697975eabd8b002d862220e58afb1a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6fc09ed3694cfe56cf8f65ff5ee302c</data>
