      <data key="d2">利润总额is a total profit figure reported in the financial statements.&lt;SEP&gt;利润总额is the total profit reported by the company for the periods 2016-2019, with values of 631.80, 3,816.07, 5,140.02, and 125.82 (in ten thousand yuan).</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d67c4855ed613e5a5fb6557e3b5e3f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e392bb86bc3233d11d6daf07ec661482</data>
