      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="营业成本">
      <data key="d0">营业成本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">营业成本is a financial metric representing operating costs, with values reported for each period.&lt;SEP&gt;营业成本is a cost of revenue figure reported in the financial statements.&lt;SEP&gt;营业成本is the cost of goods sold recognized upon revenue confirmation.&lt;SEP&gt;营业成本refers to the company's operating costs, including direct materials, direct labor, project R&amp;D costs, and project implementation costs.&lt;SEP&gt;营业成本is the operating cost of a company, which includes transferred project R&amp;D and implementation costs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d67c4855ed613e5a5fb6557e3b5e3f3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68fc75e0518c7a7c27f8e04edf36f2d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89b412cfc15b061e0a7f50978f8d7142&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b659c02f075465fc5496f416010543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3db02b7a53a4e90d8deaab369f15f7a8</data>
