    <node id="Bad Debt Provision">
      <data key="d0">Bad Debt Provision</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Bad debt provision is the estimated amount set aside for expected credit losses on accounts receivable, based on historical experience and forward-looking estimates.&lt;SEP&gt;Bad debt provision is an allowance for uncollectible receivables, calculated based on aging percentages ranging from 5% to 100%.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2aa3063ca8148fef0d6b0b98a6b6e563&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67a0e15a163891dc3165e7d1e9a9c5cf</data>
