      <data key="d2">2019年第四次临时股东大会is a specific shareholders' meeting held on August 17, 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年第四次临时股东大会is a shareholder meeting held on 2019年8月17日.&lt;SEP&gt;The 2019 Fourth Extraordinary General Meeting of Shareholders was held on August 17, 2019, to review and approve resolutions on related party transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;2019年第四次临时股东大会审议通过了关于2019年度关联交易预计的议案。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8ea770b7c76363fae7c405ea9d01af81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5c0c72057a06111028608a0973aef2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-507e2b6ca2f473187fea2747ef444ec5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-296a72753256021351c386543f50f98c</data>
