      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">视音频中间件是处于操作系统和应用程序之间的基础服务软件，用于管理视音频数据和通信。&lt;SEP&gt;视音频中间件is a core concept proposed by程家明, defining a basic architecture and technical route for audio and video processing, used in the development of military video command systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b84096a6e6d9f55493f1531e413c38d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58b70a42920a91dffdca8121d66a66eb</data>
