      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">财务担保合同are financial guarantee contracts, classified as financial liabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;财务担保合同是公司提供的担保义务，按特定规则进行后续计量。&lt;SEP&gt;财务担保合同refers to financial guarantee contracts, a type of financial liability with specific measurement rules.</data>
