      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A proposal regarding the estimated related party transactions for the 2019 fiscal year, approved by the shareholders' meeting.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-507e2b6ca2f473187fea2747ef444ec5</data>
