      <data key="d0">预计公司2019年度关联交易(关键管理人员薪酬)的议案</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A proposal regarding the estimated related party transactions for 2019, specifically concerning key management personnel compensation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-507e2b6ca2f473187fea2747ef444ec5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
