    <node id="对外担保">
      <data key="d0">对外担保</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">对外担保是公司为其他企业提供的担保，报告期内发行人不存在为控股股东、实际控制人及其控制的其他企业担保的情况。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="资产完整">
      <data key="d0">资产完整</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">资产完整是公司独立运营的一个方面，指公司具备与生产经营有关的主要生产系统、辅助生产系统和配套设施，并合法拥有相关资产的所有权或使用权。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="资产合计">
      <data key="d0">资产合计</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Total assets, a total on the balance sheet, with amounts listed for various dates.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-507e2b6ca2f473187fea2747ef444ec5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="应付职工薪酬">
      <data key="d0">应付职工薪酬</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Employee compensation payable, a current liability item on the balance sheet, with amounts listed for various dates.&lt;SEP&gt;应付职工薪酬refers to employee compensation payable, with balances of 588.58, 785.62, 1,083.77, and 489.35 (in 10,000 yuan) at the end of each reporting period.&lt;SEP&gt;应付职工薪酬refers to employee compensation payable, including wages, bonuses, and benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;应付职工薪酬refers to accrued employee compensation, a liability on the balance sheet.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-507e2b6ca2f473187fea2747ef444ec5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6e696543cb80f28d3b65e84c277dcc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcbf57eb9842bd218c6161d81c243df9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a063631d4607acf73ebaf006ed030c5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279675</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Initial Investment Cost">
      <data key="d0">Initial Investment Cost</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The initial investment cost is the amount recorded for a long-term equity investment, determined based on the merger method or the fair value of the consideration paid.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-715426c8536b679514108da2caab6b17</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Capital Reserve">
      <data key="d0">Capital Reserve</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Capital reserve is an equity account adjusted for the difference between the initial investment cost and the book value of the investment in a business combination under common control.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-715426c8536b679514108da2caab6b17</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Retained Earnings">
      <data key="d0">Retained Earnings</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Retained earnings are adjusted when the capital reserve is insufficient to cover the difference in a business combination under common control.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-715426c8536b679514108da2caab6b17</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="人员独立">
      <data key="d0">人员独立</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">人员独立是公司独立运营的一个方面，指公司董事、监事以及高级管理人员均按规定程序选举或聘任，且不在控股股东、实际控制人及其控制的其他企业中担任除董事、监事以外的其他职务或领薪。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Business Combination Under Common Control">
      <data key="d0">Business Combination Under Common Control</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A business combination where the combining entities are under the same ultimate control before and after the combination.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-715426c8536b679514108da2caab6b17</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Business Combination Not Under Common Control">
      <data key="d0">Business Combination Not Under Common Control</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A business combination where the combining entities are not under the same ultimate control.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-715426c8536b679514108da2caab6b17</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="副总经理">
      <data key="d0">副总经理</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">副总经理是公司的高级管理人员，不在控股股东、实际控制人及其控制的其他企业中担任除董事、监事以外的其他职务。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="财务负责人">
      <data key="d0">财务负责人</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">财务负责人是公司的高级管理人员，不在控股股东、实际控制人及其控制的其他企业中担任除董事、监事以外的其他职务。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="董事会秘书">
      <data key="d0">董事会秘书</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The Board Secretary is an individual who exercises rights and fulfills duties according to the Company Charter and relevant work rules.&lt;SEP&gt;董事会秘书是公司的高级管理人员，不在控股股东、实际控制人及其控制的其他企业中担任除董事、监事以外的其他职务。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e33d1b358ec992265a4a1fbb025624f1</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Fair Value">
      <data key="d0">Fair Value</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Fair value is the price that would be received to sell an asset or paid to transfer a liability in an orderly transaction between market participants.&lt;SEP&gt;The value of equity instruments used to measure share-based payment transactions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-715426c8536b679514108da2caab6b17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32adcca902f2d818c44b9e6713cc9db6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="财务独立">
      <data key="d0">财务独立</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">财务独立是公司独立运营的一个方面，指公司已建立独立的财务核算体系、能够独立作出财务决策、具有规范的财务会计制度和对分公司、子公司的财务管理制度。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-450f069284fc5692d5ade6bb4aeb0deb</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Cost Method">
      <data key="d0">Cost Method</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The cost method is an accounting method for long-term equity investments where the investment is recorded at cost and income is recognized only when dividends are received.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-715426c8536b679514108da2caab6b17</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277843</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Equity Method">
      <data key="d0">Equity Method</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The equity method is an accounting method for long-term equity investments where the investment is initially recorded at cost and subsequently adjusted for the investor's share of the investee's profits or losses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-715426c8536b679514108da2caab6b17</data>
