      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Fixed assets are tangible assets held for use in the production or supply of goods or services, for rental to others, or for administrative purposes, and are expected to be used for more than one accounting period.&lt;SEP&gt;Fixed assets are long-term tangible assets held by the company, including buildings, office equipment, transportation equipment, and electronic equipment.</data>
