      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The prospectus is a legal document issued by a company to invite the public to subscribe for its securities.&lt;SEP&gt;The document containing the company's financial information and accounting policies.&lt;SEP&gt;The prospectus is the official document containing the company's financial information and details.</data>
