      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">湖北省支柱产业细分领域隐形冠军培育企业is a provincial-level honor received by the company in 2018 for its networked video command system.&lt;SEP&gt;湖北省支柱产业细分领域隐形冠军培育企业is a designation for companies recognized as hidden champions in specific segments of Hubei's pillar industries.&lt;SEP&gt;湖北省支柱产业细分领域隐形冠军培育企业是湖北省经济和信息化厅授予的荣誉，兴图新科因网络化视频指挥系统获得。</data>
