    <node id="现金股利">
      <data key="d0">现金股利</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">现金股利是可供出售权益工具投资发放的股利，计入投资收益。&lt;SEP&gt;现金股利represents cash dividends paid by the company, amounting to 522.50万元in 2018.&lt;SEP&gt;现金股利是公司发放的股利，2019年上半年发放1,490.40万元，导致货币资金减少。&lt;SEP&gt;现金股利(Cash Dividends) is a financial item representing cash dividends paid, with values 1,490.40, 522.50, 0, and 660.00.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c2bef4da9888c968bf50ff56e94e6b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613cb627993033fd744548e00f8faf30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acf02a504557f18cdbf2cc5a70e82348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bdc3ef17a314565d7acb2ce2a958a2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
