    <node id="金融负债">
      <data key="d0">金融负债</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">金融负债是公司承担的具有金融价值的负债，包括交易性金融负债和指定为以公允价值计量的负债。&lt;SEP&gt;金融负债是公司承担的金融义务，与金融资产转移相关。&lt;SEP&gt;金融负债refers to financial liabilities, classified into categories such as those measured at fair value and other financial liabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;金融负债是公司承担的具有金融性质的负债，其确认和终止有特定条件。&lt;SEP&gt;金融负债is a financial liability under accounting standards, representing a contractual obligation to deliver cash.&lt;SEP&gt;金融负债是科电子股份有限公司对投资款的初始会计分类，后因条件满足转换为权益工具。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c2bef4da9888c968bf50ff56e94e6b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fca02fbab0d237ce11800b5b73d4efd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-539084abf02778219d4ddbf72bcaedc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7668c3b124574e151ac4d9b6ed102b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01d7f72fd8388e6df3d5050f1db0fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf933ea6ad543d32c5edbe9d972ca701</data>
