      <data key="d0">高新技术企业证书</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">高新技术企业证书is a certificate issued by湖北省科学技术厅/湖北省财政厅/湖北省国家税务局/湖北省地方税务局, valid until 2020年11月29日.&lt;SEP&gt;高新技术企业证书is a certificate issued to companies recognized as high-tech enterprises, with a validity period of three years.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-654210e4a83c095d604993852216dccb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-857c6cd5771be1b1e45b108bfca98c50</data>
