    <node id="减值准备">
      <data key="d0">减值准备</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">减值准备是金融资产发生减值时计提的准备金，用于确认减值损失。&lt;SEP&gt;减值准备is a provision for impairment on accounts receivable that are deemed unlikely to be collected.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c2bef4da9888c968bf50ff56e94e6b50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93fb79958d661926096c59442d227d57</data>
