    <node id="设定提存计划">
      <data key="d0">设定提存计划</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">设定提存计划是离职后福利的一种，根据计算应缴存金额确认为负债并计入当期损益或资产成本。&lt;SEP&gt;设定提存计划是一种职工薪酬计划，用于处理其他长期职工福利的会计方法。&lt;SEP&gt;设定提存计划refers to defined contribution plans, such as basic pension and unemployment insurance.&lt;SEP&gt;设定提存计划is a defined contribution plan, a type of employee benefit plan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-662e7d9b9eb2689b664f1c99bb66d9b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54182f60d42d7ae398cdb80bfecd4e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6e696543cb80f28d3b65e84c277dcc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcbf57eb9842bd218c6161d81c243df9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
