    <node id="应收商业承兑汇票">
      <data key="d0">应收商业承兑汇票</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">应收商业承兑汇票refers to trade acceptance receivables, a type of financial asset with expected credit loss rates based on aging.&lt;SEP&gt;应收商业承兑汇票是一种金融票据，其坏账准备计提比例根据账龄不同而变化，账龄起算点追溯至对应的应收款项账龄起始日。&lt;SEP&gt;应收商业承兑汇票是公司持有的商业承兑汇票，需计提坏账准备。&lt;SEP&gt;应收商业承兑汇票refers to the receivable commercial acceptance bills that have been endorsed but not yet matured, with amounts of 40万元and 387.62万元at specific dates.&lt;SEP&gt;应收商业承兑汇票is commercial acceptance bills receivable, for which a bad debt provision of 1.063 million yuan was made in the first half of 2019.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e0d0ee3d0d23d40d115272270f54f621&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7668c3b124574e151ac4d9b6ed102b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a754cb39a70a7b6942e8d85cc566af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a43fca9e573d5142853f858f459e3659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279159</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
