    </node>
    <node id="摊余成本">
      <data key="d0">摊余成本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">摊余成本是金融资产或负债的初始确认金额经调整后的账面价值，用于后续计量。&lt;SEP&gt;摊余成本refers to amortized cost, used for measuring held-to-maturity investments, loans, receivables, and financial liabilities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fca02fbab0d237ce11800b5b73d4efd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7668c3b124574e151ac4d9b6ed102b9f</data>
