    <node id="贷款承诺">
      <data key="d0">贷款承诺</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">贷款承诺是公司以低于市场利率提供贷款的承诺，按特定规则进行后续计量。&lt;SEP&gt;贷款承诺refers to loan commitments, a type of financial liability with specific measurement rules.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fca02fbab0d237ce11800b5b73d4efd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7668c3b124574e151ac4d9b6ed102b9f</data>
