    <node id="收入确认">
      <data key="d0">收入确认</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">收入确认是审计中的关键审计事项之一，涉及公司销售产品后确认收入的条件和时点。&lt;SEP&gt;收入确认是公司根据会计准则和合同条款，在满足条件时确认销售收入的过程。&lt;SEP&gt;收入确认is the accounting principle for recognizing revenue, influenced by customer procurement and acceptance schedules.&lt;SEP&gt;收入确认is the accounting concept of recognizing revenue based on product acceptance confirmation.&lt;SEP&gt;收入确认is the revenue recognition process, which is concentrated in the fourth quarter due to the military procurement cycle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3886638a85ee14393d1da2d826028ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71315edcb276c478ee7e17161d92bff9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8558b195ba00af38286850b482d4bbf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-514d21a96f5f12f55e31d1c553bfaec6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25d86c858ab99da23adbe0a6a1090d48</data>
