    <node id="湖北省科技成果奖">
      <data key="d0">湖北省科技成果奖</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">湖北省科技成果奖is a provincial-level science and technology achievement award received by the company in 2013 for its cloud-based integrated audio and video service platform.&lt;SEP&gt;湖北省科技成果奖是湖北省科学技术厅颁发的奖项，授予兴图新科的基于云计算的一体化音视频服务平台。</data>
