    </node>
    <node id="内部控制制度">
      <data key="d0">内部控制制度</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The internal control system is a set of regulations established by the company's management to ensure operational efficiency and risk management.&lt;SEP&gt;内部控制制度is the internal control system implemented by the company to manage the establishment of R&amp;D teams and the collection of project R&amp;D costs.&lt;SEP&gt;内部控制制度是公司为规范项目研发成本归集而制定的管理制度，包括审批流程和文件下达。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e33d1b358ec992265a4a1fbb025624f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5334769d50f0761b2a448b4d71832e04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a45c8bf27ca08a4750c1a37f5f6a5f44</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279703</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="企业会计准则">
      <data key="d0">企业会计准则</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">企业会计准则是公司编制财务报表所遵循的标准，确保财务信息真实完整。&lt;SEP&gt;企业会计准则是公司收入确认的依据，结合经营情况和合同条款执行。&lt;SEP&gt;企业会计准则is the set of accounting standards guiding the company's financial reporting.&lt;SEP&gt;企业会计准则refers to the accounting standards that the company must comply with regarding the capitalization of R&amp;D costs.&lt;SEP&gt;企业会计准则规定了存货确认和跌价准备计提的会计处理方法。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a54182f60d42d7ae398cdb80bfecd4e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0423780d8b9cfac69a906ddafd659e0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8bca8da2081d34328a41b4a7e5e979d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b6eddb53d74c83ec7f5f6b39738bdf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5334769d50f0761b2a448b4d71832e04</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279695</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
