      <data key="d0">持续经营净利润</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">持续经营净利润is the net profit from continuing operations, reported as part of the income statement.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277863</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="内部控制鉴证报告">
      <data key="d0">内部控制鉴证报告</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Internal Control Assurance Report (Tian Jian Shen [2019] No. 2-548) provides an opinion on the effectiveness of the company's internal controls.&lt;SEP&gt;The internal control assurance report (Tianjian Shen [2019] 2-508) is a document issued by the accounting firm.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e33d1b358ec992265a4a1fbb025624f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec025d53a56038a876436730c19cdf15</data>
