    <node id="其他综合收益的税后净额">
      <data key="d0">其他综合收益的税后净额</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">其他综合收益的税后净额is the after-tax amount of other comprehensive income, reported as zero for all periods.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277863</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="公司章程(草案)">
      <data key="d0">公司章程(草案)</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The Company Charter (Draft) is a regulatory document that includes provisions for related party transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;The公司章程(草案) is a draft of the company's articles of association that includes provisions for profit distribution and investor protection.&lt;SEP&gt;公司章程(草案)是公司内部治理文件，规定了股东大会投票机制等事项。&lt;SEP&gt;公司章程(草案)是公司依据科创板业务规则制定的内部治理文件，明确规定了利润分配政策等内容。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e33d1b358ec992265a4a1fbb025624f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad4c2dae4e12654bb3e81ead3541cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-735c1e7025b476d06d2968a85d58fc1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f72c84ae0acbd2472ea50de1b750541e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280457</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="综合收益总额">
      <data key="d0">综合收益总额</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">综合收益总额is the total comprehensive income, matching the net profit figures for the periods.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277863</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="所得税费用">
      <data key="d0">所得税费用</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">所得税费用is the income tax expense deducted from profit before tax to arrive at net profit.&lt;SEP&gt;所得税费用是公司财务报表中的项目，受会计政策变更影响。&lt;SEP&gt;所得税费用is an income statement item representing income tax expense, with an adjusted amount of 528,987.30元in 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;所得税费用is an accounting concept representing income tax expense.&lt;SEP&gt;所得税费用is the income tax expense reported by the company for the periods 2016-2019, with values of 170.82, 700.73, 918.64, and 52.90 (in ten thousand yuan).&lt;SEP&gt;所得税费用is income tax expense, comprising current income tax expense and deferred income tax expense for the company.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a754cb39a70a7b6942e8d85cc566af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a7d8a8f50f4153ffa81ab184218607&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8bca8da2081d34328a41b4a7e5e979d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2eba65f4c30e7eca6d8a001e85414c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e392bb86bc3233d11d6daf07ec661482</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279154</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="合并现金流量表">
      <data key="d0">合并现金流量表</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">合并现金流量表is the consolidated cash flow statement included in the prospectus.&lt;SEP&gt;合并现金流量表是反映公司合并现金流量的报表，包含经营活动、投资活动和筹资活动产生的现金流量净额等数据。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-66bf9577dcccaac7aa541c5650962f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69cce5e179e4c8387e8545ca3815ae21</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780277863</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="董事会制度">
