    <node id="联合验收总结报告">
      <data key="d0">联合验收总结报告</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">联合验收总结报告是由军方用户组织联合验收后出具的报告，用于特定合同下的收入确认。&lt;SEP&gt;联合验收总结报告is a summary report of the joint acceptance inspection.&lt;SEP&gt;联合验收总结报告是由多家单位专家共同出具的验收文件，用于确认项目验收合格。&lt;SEP&gt;联合验收总结报告is a joint acceptance summary report used as revenue recognition basis for contracts XT2017023 and XT2017120.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-71315edcb276c478ee7e17161d92bff9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8227158700119014195f573b2aa0ea3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b40d68046d1b322f632240872bb6525a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3de0c8b0c77ab6bc474ead023bc128f</data>
