      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">到货确认书是客户在收到货物并验收合格后出具的单据，用于收入确认。&lt;SEP&gt;到货确认书is a document confirming product arrival.&lt;SEP&gt;到货确认书is a delivery confirmation document used as revenue recognition basis for contracts XT2018116, XT2018117, and XT2018118.</data>
