    <node id="军事代表">
      <data key="d0">军事代表</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">军事代表是军方代表，负责对产品进行军检并签署相关单据。&lt;SEP&gt;军事代表is a military representative who conducts product inspection and acceptance.&lt;SEP&gt;军事代表is a person who inspects and approves products before shipment.&lt;SEP&gt;军事代表is the military representative responsible for inspection and acceptance.&lt;SEP&gt;军事代表is a military representative who conducts inspection and acceptance of products at the factory.</data>
