    <node id="直接材料">
      <data key="d0">直接材料</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">直接材料是生产过程中直接耗用并构成产品实体的主要材料、辅助材料等。&lt;SEP&gt;直接材料refers to direct material costs, which are a major component of operating costs, including raw materials and purchased components.&lt;SEP&gt;直接材料refers to direct material costs in the company's operating costs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b25c1709d3d8634e2bf9aa86a05beec5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b659c02f075465fc5496f416010543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be0da8d1f5fb8afb0f6838ed3366b2db</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279155</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="直接人工">
      <data key="d0">直接人工</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">直接人工是本公司直接从事产品生产的人员工资等。&lt;SEP&gt;直接人工refers to direct labor costs, representing the labor expenses incurred in production.&lt;SEP&gt;直接人工refers to direct labor costs in the company's operating costs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b25c1709d3d8634e2bf9aa86a05beec5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b659c02f075465fc5496f416010543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be0da8d1f5fb8afb0f6838ed3366b2db</data>
