    <node id="Platform Research Department">
      <data key="d0">Platform Research Department</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Platform Research Department is responsible for establishing and improving the company's technical R&amp;D system, designing and implementing core system modules, and conducting key technology pre-research and problem-solving. It is the company's overall design unit.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b810ef07f1562ed37e767bba89672005</data>
