    <node id="Hardware Design Department">
      <data key="d0">Hardware Design Department</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Hardware Design Department is responsible for product design and implementation of hardware, including codecs, all-in-one machines, and external peripheral devices, based on overall development requirements and system design. It produces prototype samples and hands them over to the Testing Department for testing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b810ef07f1562ed37e767bba89672005</data>
