    <node id="Terminal Products Department">
      <data key="d0">Terminal Products Department</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Terminal Products Department is responsible for product design and implementation of terminal equipment, including general terminals, command terminals, and integrated devices. It develops embedded operating software that runs under the video and audio system.</data>
