    <node id="Business Systems Department">
      <data key="d0">Business Systems Department</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Business Systems Department is responsible for integrating platform software, terminal software, and hardware into complete systems, conducting packaging, joint testing, and consolidation. It is the overall unit for the system development process and handles security settings.</data>
