    <node id="银行承兑汇票">
      <data key="d0">银行承兑汇票</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">银行承兑汇票是应收票据中承兑人为信用风险较小的银行的组合。&lt;SEP&gt;银行承兑汇票represents bank acceptance bills, with 465.82万元issued in 2018, of which 80.52万元were issued to subsidiary华创兴图.&lt;SEP&gt;银行承兑汇票是一种付款方式，由奥维通信股份有限公司开具，已于2019年1月兑付。&lt;SEP&gt;银行承兑汇票are bank acceptance bills used for settlement, such as 1-month bills by奥维通信股份有限公司in 2018.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-36712d9113d14632f0fb71d06e864ed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613cb627993033fd744548e00f8faf30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccbca840e9b72177073f20adad793e2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acf02a504557f18cdbf2cc5a70e82348</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279671</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="数据库">
