    <node id="商业承兑汇票">
      <data key="d0">商业承兑汇票</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">商业承兑汇票是应收票据中类似账龄的款项信用风险特征相似的组合。&lt;SEP&gt;商业承兑汇票is a type of commercial acceptance bill issued by large central enterprise research institutes or listed companies, used in financial transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;商业承兑汇票是一种付款方式，公司收到的商业承兑汇票可收回性较强。&lt;SEP&gt;商业承兑汇票are commercial acceptance bills used for settlement, such as 3-month bills by奥维通信股份有限公司in 2019.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-36712d9113d14632f0fb71d06e864ed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a754cb39a70a7b6942e8d85cc566af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccbca840e9b72177073f20adad793e2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acf02a504557f18cdbf2cc5a70e82348</data>
