      <data key="d2">账龄是公司划分应收商业承兑汇票和应收账款预期信用损失率的依据。&lt;SEP&gt;账龄refers to the aging period of financial assets, used to determine expected credit loss rates.&lt;SEP&gt;账龄refers to the aging of accounts receivable, categorized into time intervals such as 1年以内, 1-2年, etc.</data>
