    <node id="期后回款">
      <data key="d0">期后回款</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">期后回款是指资产负债表日后应收账款的收回情况，用于评价坏账准备合理性。&lt;SEP&gt;期后回款refers to post-period collections of accounts receivable, with amounts and ratios disclosed for direct military clients.&lt;SEP&gt;期后回款refers to post-period collection of receivables.</data>
