    <node id="政府补助">
      <data key="d0">政府补助</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">政府补助是公司从政府获得的资金支持，分为与资产相关的政府补助和与收益相关的政府补助。&lt;SEP&gt;政府补助是公司调整的会计政策内容，涉及其他收益和营业外收入项目的调整。&lt;SEP&gt;政府补助is a government grant, including VAT refunds for military products and software industry, recognized as other income.&lt;SEP&gt;政府补助refers to government subsidies received by the company, including items such as VAT refunds, R&amp;D subsidies, and loan interest subsidies, which are recorded in non-operating income or other income.&lt;SEP&gt;政府补助is the government subsidy income included in non-recurring gains and losses, with values of 72.05, 177.00, 242.38, and 72.07 (in ten thousand yuan) for the periods 2016-2019.&lt;SEP&gt;政府补助是计入当期损益的非经常性损益主要内容，与公司正常经营业务密切相关，符合国家政策规定。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f202ac667cfc8976d9619692684e19e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a7d8a8f50f4153ffa81ab184218607&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e1dba94cb980071bc66361c9d801df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2eba65f4c30e7eca6d8a001e85414c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e392bb86bc3233d11d6daf07ec661482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279116</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
