      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">关联方资金拆借is a specific type of occasional related-party transaction involving borrowing and repayment of funds between武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司and its related parties.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f944c8f4f3100f826c0cf74b0febe515</data>
