    <node id="资金使用成本">
      <data key="d0">资金使用成本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">资金使用成本refers to the cost of using capital, calculated based on the one-year loan prime rate, and was accrued by the company for the second-phase investment funds.&lt;SEP&gt;资金使用成本is a concept representing the cost of using funds, related to interest charges on investment payments.&lt;SEP&gt;资金使用成本is the cost of using funds, calculated at an annualized 6% compound interest or based on the one-year loan benchmark interest rate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-22ebce0fbc7929f451f894a801d9e061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8bca8da2081d34328a41b4a7e5e979d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f228f520bdad2789dde12421b268460</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
