    </node>
    <node id="补充协议">
      <data key="d0">补充协议</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">补充协议is the supplementary agreement signed between the company, 光谷人才创投, 广垦太证, and程家明, outlining investment terms and capital usage costs.&lt;SEP&gt;补充协议is a supplementary agreement between武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司and investors regarding fund usage costs.&lt;SEP&gt;补充协议is a supplementary agreement that modifies and clarifies the terms of the original investment agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;补充协议is a supplementary agreement to the investment agreement, detailing additional terms such as performance conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;补充协议is a supplementary agreement that includes valuation adjustment clauses and conditions for investment.&lt;SEP&gt;补充协议是科电子股份有限公司与投资方签订的协议，规定投资款转换条件。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-22ebce0fbc7929f451f894a801d9e061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8bca8da2081d34328a41b4a7e5e979d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8720e7aa67adb2980b4973af48e4b91b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a01d7f72fd8388e6df3d5050f1db0fb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf933ea6ad543d32c5edbe9d972ca701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f228f520bdad2789dde12421b268460</data>
