    <node id="告知函">
      <data key="d0">告知函</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">告知函is a notification letter issued by光谷人才创投and广垦太证to the company, waiving their right to collect capital usage costs.&lt;SEP&gt;告知函is a formal notification from光谷人才创投and广垦太证waiving their right to collect fund usage costs.&lt;SEP&gt;告知函is a formal notice from光谷人才创投and广垦太证to the company, waiving certain rights to charge capital usage costs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-22ebce0fbc7929f451f894a801d9e061&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8bca8da2081d34328a41b4a7e5e979d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf933ea6ad543d32c5edbe9d972ca701</data>
