    <node id="非经常性损益">
      <data key="d0">非经常性损益</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">非经常性损益是指公司发生的与主营业务无关的、不经常发生的损益项目，如政府补助等。&lt;SEP&gt;非经常性损益refers to irregular gains and losses, including disposal of non-current assets and government subsidies.&lt;SEP&gt;非经常性损益is a financial concept representing non-recurring gains and losses.&lt;SEP&gt;非经常性损益is the non-recurring gains and losses reported by the company for the periods 2016-2019, including items like government subsidies and asset disposal gains or losses.&lt;SEP&gt;非经常性损益是公司报告期内计入当期损益的政府补助及其他营业外收支，其占比逐渐降低。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-69cce5e179e4c8387e8545ca3815ae21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-857c6cd5771be1b1e45b108bfca98c50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35a409f0c18103033f1c4f6387ed11cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e1dba94cb980071bc66361c9d801df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e392bb86bc3233d11d6daf07ec661482</data>
