    <node id="企业会计准则23号-金融资产转移">
      <data key="d0">企业会计准则23号-金融资产转移</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">该准则规定了金融资产转移的相关会计处理，涉及应收票据相关差错更正。&lt;SEP&gt;企业会计准则23号-金融资产转移is an accounting standard that governs the transfer of financial assets and the recognition of related rights and obligations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-80a754cb39a70a7b6942e8d85cc566af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2a7d8a8f50f4153ffa81ab184218607</data>
