      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">会计差错更正及追溯调整的议案is a proposal regarding the correction of accounting errors and retrospective adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;The会计差错更正及追溯调整的议案is a proposal regarding the correction of accounting errors and retrospective adjustments, approved by the board.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-80a754cb39a70a7b6942e8d85cc566af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8b769f0b1dab26f09748ff9020c177a</data>
