    <node id="显示设备">
      <data key="d0">显示设备</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">显示设备是公司产品所需的原材料之一，采购金额在2017年显著增加。&lt;SEP&gt;显示设备are display devices procured by the company, with procurement amounts fluctuating due to military customization in 2017.&lt;SEP&gt;显示设备is a category of display equipment procured by the company, with procurement data listed for various years.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-da8fc31188e449d6106dadda0587623f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09841b91427b70d08c09d01179754ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f803e4453a24e458607776c5e60c8e2</data>
