      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">计算机设备及部件是公司产品所需的原材料之一，采购金额在报告期内相对稳定。&lt;SEP&gt;计算机设备及部件are computer equipment and components procured by the company, categorized into standardized, customized, and personalized types.&lt;SEP&gt;计算机设备及部件includes computer equipment and computer components such as mice, hard drives, power supplies, and CPUs, procured by the company.</data>
