    <node id="信用减值损失">
      <data key="d0">信用减值损失</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">信用减值损失is an income statement item representing credit impairment losses, with an adjusted amount of 2,175,580.00元in 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;信用减值损失is an accounting concept representing credit impairment losses.&lt;SEP&gt;信用减值损失is a financial concept representing losses from credit impairment, which was 2.1756 million yuan for the first half of 2019.</data>
