      <data key="d2">包装耗材是公司产品所需的原材料之一，采购金额在报告期内相对较小。&lt;SEP&gt;包装耗材are packaging consumables procured by the company, with procurement data reported across different periods.&lt;SEP&gt;包装耗材is a category of packaging materials procured by the company, with procurement data listed for various years.</data>
