    <node id="其他">
      <data key="d0">其他</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">其他refers to other miscellaneous raw materials procured by the company, with procurement data reported across different periods.&lt;SEP&gt;其他is a miscellaneous category of procured items, with procurement data listed for various years.&lt;SEP&gt;其他refers to other product categories of the company, generating revenue and costs.&lt;SEP&gt;其他represents other miscellaneous products or revenue items not classified as self-produced or supporting.&lt;SEP&gt;其他是公司单独销售的产品类型之一，包含未明确分类的设备或产品。&lt;SEP&gt;其他is a product category for other miscellaneous items, with associated cost breakdowns across multiple years.&lt;SEP&gt;其他refers to other miscellaneous expenses, a component of sales expenses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-da8fc31188e449d6106dadda0587623f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09841b91427b70d08c09d01179754ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-857c6cd5771be1b1e45b108bfca98c50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cb7ea60b6bc057b91edb59c37463f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24d2a0eeb5394c1bb2920dce48699105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f50b98f3148cfa787df9553aa64c7e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be0da8d1f5fb8afb0f6838ed3366b2db</data>
