    <node id="XT2017072">
      <data key="d0">XT2017072</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">XT2017072 is a contract number for an equipment maintenance contract with unit C.&lt;SEP&gt;XT2017072 is a contract identifier associated with Unit C, involving equipment delivery and inspection procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;XT2017072 is a contract that uses the equipment delivery handover document as revenue recognition basis.&lt;SEP&gt;XT2017072 is a contract number for an equipment maintenance material contract with单位C.</data>
