    <node id="带宽侦测技术">
      <data key="d0">带宽侦测技术</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">带宽侦测技术利用网络环境下正在收发的媒体流自带数据进行探测分析，不额外增加网络流量负载，可支持64路并发媒体流收发的同时侦测处理。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-931e9f8ff947a254d2e37023beedf406</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780278478</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="拥塞探测技术">
      <data key="d0">拥塞探测技术</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">拥塞探测技术根据单向时延梯度和客户端实际媒体接收码率计算网络可用带宽，解决了可用带宽探测误差率与网络环境丢包率成正比的问题。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-931e9f8ff947a254d2e37023beedf406</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780278478</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="XT2017023">
      <data key="d0">XT2017023</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">XT2017023 is a contract identifier associated with Xingtang Communication Technology Co., Ltd., involving product delivery and payment terms.&lt;SEP&gt;XT2017023 is a contract with a contract amount of 8.915 million yuan, related to a military video renovation project.&lt;SEP&gt;XT2017023 is a contract that uses the joint acceptance summary report and product acceptance confirmation form as revenue recognition basis.&lt;SEP&gt;XT2017023 is a contract number for the某军队视频整治项目.&lt;SEP&gt;XT2017023 is a contract/lot number for the视频指挥控制系统(video command and control system) within the military video renovation project.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-537a32c63f40cfc7cf6744dfdd6838d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-146af96f6ee6ac7b66eefff49c0f3756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3de0c8b0c77ab6bc474ead023bc128f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5334769d50f0761b2a448b4d71832e04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-175c27ddefde22d232ee5626c7b540cf</data>
