    <node id="财务费用">
      <data key="d0">财务费用</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">财务费用is a profit and loss account item that was adjusted as part of the accounting error correction.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial expenses, which are a component of period expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;财务费用是公司报告期内的财务支出，包括利息支出、利息收入和手续费，规模较小。&lt;SEP&gt;财务费用is a financial concept representing the cost of borrowing, which was relatively small for the company due to low bank loan amounts.&lt;SEP&gt;财务费用(Financial Expenses) is a financial item representing costs like interest, with values 74.60, 119.42, 308.42, and 225.23.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a8b769f0b1dab26f09748ff9020c177a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dbd7f23e2450a66d1c4a2a65445e5af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ed1a8d926463f9c93dbf74639c94654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16bdc3ef17a314565d7acb2ce2a958a2</data>
