    <node id="企业所得税">
      <data key="d0">企业所得税</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">企业所得税is a tax levied on the taxable income of enterprises, with applicable rates of 15% and 25%.&lt;SEP&gt;企业所得税是公司应交税费的主要组成部分之一，报告期内各期末有相应的未交数、应交数和已交数。&lt;SEP&gt;企业所得税is corporate income tax, a tax on company profits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-857c6cd5771be1b1e45b108bfca98c50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e1dba94cb980071bc66361c9d801df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcbf57eb9842bd218c6161d81c243df9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279706</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="增值税">
      <data key="d0">增值税</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">增值税is a tax on the value added to goods and services, with specific policies for software products and military products.&lt;SEP&gt;增值税是公司应交税费的主要组成部分之一，报告期内各期末有相应的未交数、应交数和已交数。&lt;SEP&gt;增值税is value-added tax (VAT), a type of tax on goods and services.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-857c6cd5771be1b1e45b108bfca98c50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67e1dba94cb980071bc66361c9d801df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcbf57eb9842bd218c6161d81c243df9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279706</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="软件产品增值税即征即退政策">
      <data key="d0">软件产品增值税即征即退政策</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">软件产品增值税即征即退政策is a policy where the actual tax burden exceeding 3% on software products is refunded immediately.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-857c6cd5771be1b1e45b108bfca98c50</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780278496</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="军工产品增值税退税或免征政策">
      <data key="d0">军工产品增值税退税或免征政策</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">军工产品增值税退税或免征政策allows qualified military products to enjoy VAT refund or exemption.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-857c6cd5771be1b1e45b108bfca98c50</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780278496</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
