    <node id="视频指挥控制类">
      <data key="d0">视频指挥控制类</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">视频指挥控制类is a product category of the company, generating revenue and costs.&lt;SEP&gt;视频指挥控制类is a product category for video command and control, which is the company's main revenue source.&lt;SEP&gt;视频指挥控制类is a category of products including self-produced and supporting products, with revenue breakdowns provided for multiple years.&lt;SEP&gt;视频指挥控制类是公司军用领域的主要产品类型，在各期收入中占比最高。&lt;SEP&gt;视频指挥控制类is a category of products or services related to video command and control, sold by the company to various customers.&lt;SEP&gt;视频指挥控制类is a product category sold by the company to its customers.&lt;SEP&gt;视频指挥控制类is a product category for video command and control, with associated cost breakdowns across multiple years.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-857c6cd5771be1b1e45b108bfca98c50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca1d4c6073e8fe4ca24324943967d75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cb7ea60b6bc057b91edb59c37463f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24d2a0eeb5394c1bb2920dce48699105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a268be32c2288ea8433062dd1b18f37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89799248c4126aacb846167b35f83e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be0da8d1f5fb8afb0f6838ed3366b2db</data>
