    <node id="视频预警控制类">
      <data key="d0">视频预警控制类</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">视频预警控制类 is a product category offered by a company, specifically focused on video early warning and control systems. This category encompasses both self-produced and supporting products, and it generates revenue and incurs costs for the company. The company reports revenue breakdowns for this category across multiple years within its reporting period. 视频预警控制类 is one of the company’s main product types, and its sales are directed toward customers in both military and civilian sectors. The products within this category are primarily used for video surveillance and early warning control applications.&lt;SEP&gt;视频预警控制类is a product category for video early warning and control, with associated cost breakdowns across multiple years.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-857c6cd5771be1b1e45b108bfca98c50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d012b93d8b658c8e32c326d8f1e487&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ca1d4c6073e8fe4ca24324943967d75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cb7ea60b6bc057b91edb59c37463f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24d2a0eeb5394c1bb2920dce48699105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a268be32c2288ea8433062dd1b18f37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ff7549276f1a5851e3d0960ead6ac02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89799248c4126aacb846167b35f83e6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be0da8d1f5fb8afb0f6838ed3366b2db</data>
