    <node id="财政部">
      <data key="d0">财政部</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">财政部是发布会计准则和通知的政府机构，影响公司的会计政策。&lt;SEP&gt;财政部是发布《关于修订印发2019年度一般企业财务报表格式的通知》的政府机构。&lt;SEP&gt;财政部is the ministry that revised the Accounting Standards for Business Enterprises No. 16 - Government Grants in 2017.&lt;SEP&gt;财政部is the Ministry of Finance, which revised the Accounting Standards for Business Enterprises No. 16 – Government Subsidies in 2017.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2a7d8a8f50f4153ffa81ab184218607&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a43fca9e573d5142853f858f459e3659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2eba65f4c30e7eca6d8a001e85414c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0</data>
