      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">应付票据及应付账款是原财务报表项目，后按通知要求分别列示为应付票据和应付账款。&lt;SEP&gt;应付票据及应付账款refers to notes payable and accounts payable, representing the company's short-term liabilities to suppliers.</data>
