    <node id="其他收益">
      <data key="d0">其他收益</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">其他收益是财务报表项目，用于列报与日常活动相关的政府补助。&lt;SEP&gt;其他收益是受政府补助调整影响的报表项目。&lt;SEP&gt;其他收益is a financial concept representing other income, primarily consisting of government grants related to daily activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2a7d8a8f50f4153ffa81ab184218607&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a43fca9e573d5142853f858f459e3659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0</data>
