    <node id="营业外收入">
      <data key="d0">营业外收入</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">营业外收入是财务报表项目，原用于列报政府补助，后变更为其他收益。&lt;SEP&gt;营业外收入是受政府补助调整影响的报表项目。&lt;SEP&gt;营业外收入is a financial concept representing non-operating income, including government grants and other items.&lt;SEP&gt;营业外收入is non-operating income, which includes government subsidies and other miscellaneous income items for the company.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2a7d8a8f50f4153ffa81ab184218607&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a43fca9e573d5142853f858f459e3659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2eba65f4c30e7eca6d8a001e85414c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0</data>
