      <data key="d2">流动比率is a liquidity ratio calculated as current assets divided by current liabilities, with values reported for 2016-2019.&lt;SEP&gt;流动比率is a short-term solvency indicator, with values reported for武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司and peer companies from 2016 to 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;流动比率is a short-term solvency indicator, calculated as current assets divided by current liabilities.</data>
