      <data key="d2">北京雨辰视美科技有限公司 is a company that specializes in the integration of military video command and control systems. The organization serves as a customer of 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, engaging in contracts related to the delivery and acceptance of products for military command system projects. These contracts are ultimately utilized by military confidential units. 北京雨辰视美科技有限公司 has been involved in specific projects, including 某军种视频值班系统项目 and 某总部集采测试项目, for which it was the contracting party. The company’s financial transactions with 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 include accounts receivable that have been fully collected in the post-period. Its credit policy for one contract stipulated a 35% payment upon contract signing and the remaining 65% by December 20, 2018, with settlements conducted via bank transfer.&lt;SEP&gt;北京雨辰视美科技有限公司is a customer that purchased networked video command systems from the company under a sales contract.</data>
