      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">企业会计准则第16号--政府补助是财政部发布的准则，规定政府补助的会计处理。&lt;SEP&gt;企业会计准则第16号--政府补助is an accounting standard revised by the Ministry of Finance in 2017, affecting the recognition of government grants.&lt;SEP&gt;企业会计准则第16号--政府补助is Accounting Standard for Business Enterprises No. 16 – Government Subsidies, revised by the Ministry of Finance in 2017, affecting how the company records government subsidies.&lt;SEP&gt;企业会计准则第16号--政府补助is an accounting standard that was revised in 2017, affecting how government subsidies were classified in the company's financial statements.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a43fca9e573d5142853f858f459e3659&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2eba65f4c30e7eca6d8a001e85414c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e392bb86bc3233d11d6daf07ec661482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0</data>
