      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">北明软件有限公司is a company that appears as a contract party in the procurement process.&lt;SEP&gt;北明软件有限公司是2016年度的民品客户，最终用户为河南省第四监狱等，销售视频预警控制类产品。&lt;SEP&gt;北明软件有限公司is an organization with overdue receivables of 179.29万元in the 2-3 year aging category, with 10.00万元collected after the period as of June 30, 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;北明软件有限公司is a customer with overdue receivables listed in the financial data.</data>
