    </node>
    <node id="主营业务成本">
      <data key="d0">主营业务成本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">主营业务成本is the cost of main business operations, a key component of operating costs.&lt;SEP&gt;主营业务成本is the cost of main business operations, to which project R&amp;D and implementation costs are transferred upon completion.&lt;SEP&gt;主营业务成本是公司销售产品时结转的成本，与研发投入成本化相关。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b6eddb53d74c83ec7f5f6b39738bdf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-175c27ddefde22d232ee5626c7b540cf</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279695</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="其他业务成本">
      <data key="d0">其他业务成本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">其他业务成本is the cost of other business operations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279093</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="人工成本">
      <data key="d0">人工成本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">人工成本is the cost of labor, a component of operating costs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279093</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
