    <node id="未回款金额">
      <data key="d0">未回款金额</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">未回款金额is the amount not yet collected, which is relatively low.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279097</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="总资产">
      <data key="d0">总资产</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">总资产是公司资产规模指标，报告期内逐年增加，主要由流动资产和非流动资产构成。&lt;SEP&gt;总资产represents the total assets of the company, which were 16,923.67万元, 23,862.02万元, 29,218.38万元, and 24,830.66万元at the end of each reporting period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-67e1dba94cb980071bc66361c9d801df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613cb627993033fd744548e00f8faf30</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279116</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="流动资产">
      <data key="d0">流动资产</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">流动资产是公司资产结构的主要部分，包括货币资金、应收票据及应收账款、存货等。&lt;SEP&gt;流动资产represents current assets, which accounted for 93.60%, 95.54%, 95.11%, and 94.12% of total assets at the end of each period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-67e1dba94cb980071bc66361c9d801df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613cb627993033fd744548e00f8faf30</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279116</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="非流动资产">
      <data key="d0">非流动资产</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">非流动资产是公司资产结构的一部分，包括固定资产、无形资产等，占比较低。&lt;SEP&gt;非流动资产are non-current assets of the company, including fixed assets and deferred tax assets.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-67e1dba94cb980071bc66361c9d801df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8176626e00ddc22142d6204442ab4426</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279707</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="研发费用率">
      <data key="d0">研发费用率</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">研发费用率是研发费用占营业收入的比例，用于比较不同公司的研发投入强度。&lt;SEP&gt;研发费用率is a financial metric representing R&amp;D expenses as a percentage of revenue, used to compare companies' R&amp;D investment levels.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7c33a304af0ab2f99ea0a8298e156a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6036f86cabe86aeee1a0975796dea0e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279139</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="集约型研发策略">
      <data key="d0">集约型研发策略</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">集约型研发策略是兴图新科因资金紧张而采取的策略，重点研发核心技术，节省研发投入。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7c33a304af0ab2f99ea0a8298e156a6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279139</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="研发人员薪酬">
      <data key="d0">研发人员薪酬</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">研发人员薪酬是研发费用的主要内容，部分被归集到生产成本中。&lt;SEP&gt;R&amp;D personnel compensation refers to the salary levels of research and development staff, which the company adjusts to remain competitive.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7c33a304af0ab2f99ea0a8298e156a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae16138fbc8e3b49ae7702f55269014</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279143</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="生产成本">
      <data key="d0">生产成本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">生产成本refers to production costs, which include project R&amp;D costs for order-based projects.&lt;SEP&gt;生产成本is the production cost, which includes project R&amp;D costs and is tracked for each project.&lt;SEP&gt;生产成本refers to production costs where some R&amp;D personnel salaries were recorded.&lt;SEP&gt;生产成本是公司生产过程中发生的成本，部分研发人员薪酬被归集到其中并结转至营业成本。&lt;SEP&gt;生产成本是公司核算产品生产过程中发生的各项费用，包括直接材料、直接人工和制造费用。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c7c33a304af0ab2f99ea0a8298e156a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1b659c02f075465fc5496f416010543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b709c7a89c74bf17a7f106e614fdf37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3db02b7a53a4e90d8deaab369f15f7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a45c8bf27ca08a4750c1a37f5f6a5f44</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279706</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="生产成本-项目研发成本">
      <data key="d0">生产成本-项目研发成本</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">生产成本-项目研发成本is the cost category where salaries of R&amp;D personnel directly involved in specific project development are recorded.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-670aa3ebf08c631aa296139c61a19e24</data>
