    <node id="无形资产-开发支出">
      <data key="d0">无形资产-开发支出</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">无形资产-开发支出is a capitalizable asset category, but no R&amp;D personnel salaries were capitalized into it.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-670aa3ebf08c631aa296139c61a19e24</data>
