    <node id="租赁费">
      <data key="d0">租赁费</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">租赁费is the rental expense for sales department properties, which varied with changes in leased area and location.&lt;SEP&gt;租赁费refers to rental expenses, a component of sales expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;租赁费refers to rental expenses within administrative expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;租赁费refers to rental fees within R&amp;D expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;租赁费refers to the rental expenses for R&amp;D premises, which remained relatively stable during the reporting period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-670aa3ebf08c631aa296139c61a19e24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae7a1fcdcb4ae2a56406409ff94164c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f50b98f3148cfa787df9553aa64c7e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b709c7a89c74bf17a7f106e614fdf37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d9e5e5c1ffaf13757a3cb839d5ad066</data>
