    <node id="兴图投资公司">
      <data key="d0">兴图投资公司</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">兴图投资公司is the holding company of兴图新科, whose shares were transferred by程家明to key employees.&lt;SEP&gt;兴图投资公司is a company whose shares were transferred by程家明to key employees.&lt;SEP&gt;兴图投资公司是一家投资公司，其股东会审议通过了股份转让议案，涉及公司控股股东程家明将股份转让给骨干员工。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dbd7f23e2450a66d1c4a2a65445e5af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae16138fbc8e3b49ae7702f55269014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6036f86cabe86aeee1a0975796dea0e</data>
