    </node>
    <node id="股权激励">
      <data key="d0">股权激励</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">股权激励is a method used by兴图新科to incentivize key employees by offering them company shares at a cost below fair value.&lt;SEP&gt;Equity incentives are a method used by the company to stabilize the R&amp;D team by granting shares to key employees.&lt;SEP&gt;股权激励是一种激励措施，通过转让股份给骨干员工，以稳定研发团队和提升公司竞争力。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dbd7f23e2450a66d1c4a2a65445e5af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae16138fbc8e3b49ae7702f55269014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6036f86cabe86aeee1a0975796dea0e</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279151</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="绩效考核体系">
      <data key="d0">绩效考核体系</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The performance appraisal system is a fair and effective mechanism used by the company to evaluate and reward employees.&lt;SEP&gt;绩效考核体系是公司建立的公平有效的评估机制，与员工绩效奖金、薪酬调整和岗位晋升相挂钩。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dbd7f23e2450a66d1c4a2a65445e5af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae16138fbc8e3b49ae7702f55269014</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780279151</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="晋升机制">
      <data key="d0">晋升机制</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The promotion mechanism is a system established by the company to provide career advancement opportunities for employees.&lt;SEP&gt;晋升机制是公司为员工提供的成长空间，与绩效考核体系相结合，以激励员工积极性。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dbd7f23e2450a66d1c4a2a65445e5af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aae16138fbc8e3b49ae7702f55269014</data>
