      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Transportation and travel expenses for sales personnel.&lt;SEP&gt;交通及差旅费refers to transportation and travel expenses within selling expenses, which increased due to more frequent business trips.&lt;SEP&gt;交通及差旅费refers to transportation and travel expenses, a component of sales expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;交通及差旅费refers to transportation and travel expenses within administrative expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;交通及差旅费refers to transportation and travel expenses within management expenses, including reimbursements for staff.</data>
