    <node id="利润分配方案">
      <data key="d0">利润分配方案</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The利润分配方案is a plan for distributing profits, which must be approved by the shareholders' meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;利润分配方案是公司关于股利分配的具体计划，需经董事会、监事会和股东大会审议通过。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ad4c2dae4e12654bb3e81ead3541cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-735c1e7025b476d06d2968a85d58fc1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c007f1fc740ba4fcb6bf207b57f3a15</data>
