    <node id="2017年度扣非税后净利润">
      <data key="d0">2017年度扣非税后净利润</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">2017年度扣非税后净利润is a financial metric used to determine conditions for the second tranche of investment.&lt;SEP&gt;2017年度扣非税后净利润is the audited net profit after tax excluding non-recurring items for the year 2017, with thresholds of 2,500.00万元and 4,500.00万元.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8720e7aa67adb2980b4973af48e4b91b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f228f520bdad2789dde12421b268460</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
