    </node>
    <node id="一期出资">
      <data key="d0">一期出资</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">一期出资refers to the first tranche of investment totaling 2,400.00万元, with specific allocation to equity and capital reserve.&lt;SEP&gt;一期出资refers to the first phase of capital contribution from光谷人才创投and广垦太证to武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, totaling 3,500.00万元and 1,500.00万元respectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8720e7aa67adb2980b4973af48e4b91b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf933ea6ad543d32c5edbe9d972ca701</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280181</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="二期出资">
      <data key="d0">二期出资</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">二期出资refers to the second tranche of investment totaling 2,600.00万元, subject to performance conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;二期出资refers to the second phase of capital contribution from光谷人才创投and广垦太证to武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, totaling 1,800.00万元and 800.00万元respectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8720e7aa67adb2980b4973af48e4b91b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf933ea6ad543d32c5edbe9d972ca701</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280181</data>
