    <node id="法定公积金">
      <data key="d0">法定公积金</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">法定公积金is a statutory reserve fund that the company must set aside from after-tax profits, as per the company's articles.&lt;SEP&gt;法定公积金是公司从税后利润中提取的储备金，提取比例为利润的10%。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-735c1e7025b476d06d2968a85d58fc1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c007f1fc740ba4fcb6bf207b57f3a15</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280181</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="任意公积金">
      <data key="d0">任意公积金</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">任意公积金is a discretionary reserve fund that the company may set aside from after-tax profits after a resolution by the shareholders' meeting.&lt;SEP&gt;任意公积金是公司经股东大会决议后从税后利润中提取的额外储备金。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-735c1e7025b476d06d2968a85d58fc1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c007f1fc740ba4fcb6bf207b57f3a15</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280181</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="资本公积金">
      <data key="d0">资本公积金</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">资本公积金is a capital reserve fund that cannot be used to cover company losses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-735c1e7025b476d06d2968a85d58fc1d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280181</data>
