      <data key="d2">经营性应付项目的增加(Increase in Operating Payables) is a financial item with values -4,034.93, 1,593.34, 1,149.28, and -24.87.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-16bdc3ef17a314565d7acb2ce2a958a2</data>
