      <data key="d2">股利分配合计(Total Dividend Distribution) is a financial metric summing cash and stock dividends, with values 1,490.40, 522.50, 247.50, and 660.00.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-16bdc3ef17a314565d7acb2ce2a958a2</data>
