      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">股利分配占净利润比重(Dividend Payout Ratio) is a financial metric showing the percentage of net profit distributed as dividends, with values 35.31%, 16.77%, 53.69%, and 53.71%.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-16bdc3ef17a314565d7acb2ce2a958a2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
