    <node id="投票权">
      <data key="d0">投票权</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">投票权是股东在股东大会上对提案进行表决的权利，公司董事会、独立董事和符合条件股东可公开征集。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63e5d2afa2bb086b998b098937fd536f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280209</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="股份锁定期">
      <data key="d0">股份锁定期</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">股份锁定期是股东在上市后一定期限内不得转让股份的承诺，包括自愿锁定和延长锁定期。&lt;SEP&gt;股份锁定期is the period during which shareholders are restricted from transferring their shares after the IPO.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63e5d2afa2bb086b998b098937fd536f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78d9a4204a692f6b81c2913448119a51</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280209</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="发行价">
      <data key="d0">发行价</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">发行价是公司股票首次公开发行的价格，用于触发股份锁定期的自动延长条件。&lt;SEP&gt;发行价is the initial public offering price of the company's stock, used as a reference for lock-up extension and minimum sale price.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63e5d2afa2bb086b998b098937fd536f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11fab67a60a21371f8a33b4f435c8355</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280211</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="除权除息">
      <data key="d0">除权除息</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">除权除息是股票价格调整事件，影响股份锁定期的计算和承诺的遵守。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63e5d2afa2bb086b998b098937fd536f</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280211</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="公司股票">
      <data key="d0">公司股票</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">公司股票refers to the shares of武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司that are subject to lock-up and trading restrictions.&lt;SEP&gt;公司股票refers to the shares of the company that are subject to lock-up, transfer, and reduction commitments.&lt;SEP&gt;公司股票是发行人发行的股权凭证，可能因未履行承诺而被采取限制转让措施。</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-78d9a4204a692f6b81c2913448119a51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11fab67a60a21371f8a33b4f435c8355&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96c42ede41c6ff4d6a78647f8a045bc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280462</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="首次公开发行股票">
      <data key="d0">首次公开发行股票</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">首次公开发行股票is the initial public offering event that triggers the share lock-up and reduction commitments.&lt;SEP&gt;首次公开发行股票is the initial public offering event of the company's shares.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-78d9a4204a692f6b81c2913448119a51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40b9d69bbf62abe14ff7f951a8f1b3dd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280213</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="减持意向">
      <data key="d0">减持意向</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">减持意向refers to the shareholders' intentions and commitments regarding the reduction of their shareholdings after the lock-up period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-78d9a4204a692f6b81c2913448119a51</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280213</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="锁定期">
      <data key="d0">锁定期</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">锁定期is a period during which shareholders are restricted from selling their shares after the IPO.&lt;SEP&gt;锁定期refers to the lock-up period during which share reduction is restricted.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-40b9d69bbf62abe14ff7f951a8f1b3dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ac79bf5c8fd0e1655f57c0fdc3c54fc</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280213</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="减持承诺">
      <data key="d0">减持承诺</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">减持承诺refers to the commitments made by the shareholders regarding the conditions and limits on selling their shares after the lock-up period.&lt;SEP&gt;减持承诺refers to the commitments made by shareholders regarding the reduction of their shareholdings after the lock-up period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-40b9d69bbf62abe14ff7f951a8f1b3dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11fab67a60a21371f8a33b4f435c8355</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280214</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="二级市场价格">
      <data key="d0">二级市场价格</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">二级市场价格is the market price of shares in the secondary market, used as a reference for share reduction pricing.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-40b9d69bbf62abe14ff7f951a8f1b3dd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280214</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="信息披露义务">
      <data key="d0">信息披露义务</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">信息披露义务is the obligation of shareholders to disclose information as required by regulations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-40b9d69bbf62abe14ff7f951a8f1b3dd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280214</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="银行存款">
      <data key="d0">银行存款</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">银行存款refers to the bank deposit account used to record the receipt of investment funds.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0f228f520bdad2789dde12421b268460</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Lock-Up Period">
      <data key="d0">Lock-Up Period</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Lock-Up Period is the duration during which shareholders are restricted from transferring their shares after the stock listing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lock-Up Period is a 36-month period from the listing date during which shares cannot be transferred.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-500c759f6b35fba4000b81cf5dcc8692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab4bf4932d168a325f6494b1024eab4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Stock Listing">
      <data key="d0">Stock Listing</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Stock Listing is the event when the company's shares begin trading on the stock exchange.&lt;SEP&gt;Stock Listing is the event of the company's shares being listed on a stock exchange.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-500c759f6b35fba4000b81cf5dcc8692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab4bf4932d168a325f6494b1024eab4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Share Transfer Restriction">
      <data key="d0">Share Transfer Restriction</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Share Transfer Restriction is the limitation on the number of shares a director or senior manager can sell annually after the lock-up period.&lt;SEP&gt;Share Transfer Restriction refers to the commitment not to transfer or entrust management of shares during the lock-up period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-500c759f6b35fba4000b81cf5dcc8692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab4bf4932d168a325f6494b1024eab4b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Price Floor Commitment">
      <data key="d0">Price Floor Commitment</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Price Floor Commitment is the promise that the selling price of shares will not be lower than the issue price within 24 months after the lock-up period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-500c759f6b35fba4000b81cf5dcc8692</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Compensation Obligation">
      <data key="d0">Compensation Obligation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Compensation Obligation is the legal responsibility to compensate the company or investors for losses caused by breach of commitments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-500c759f6b35fba4000b81cf5dcc8692</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1780280215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="股份支付费用">
      <data key="d0">股份支付费用</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">股份支付费用refers to the expense recognized for share-based payments, calculated as the difference between the fair value of equity and the actual cost paid by employees.</data>
