    <edge source="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司" target="净利润">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation (净利润, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司) describes the net profit of Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd., a financial metric reported across multiple periods from 2016 to 2019. The company disclosed net profit figures in its financial statements and in its prospectus, noting a specific net profit of 72.92万元 for the first half of 2019. The net profit data shows variability across different reporting periods, and the company estimated that its net profit for the full year of 2019 would increase compared to 2018.

The company has highlighted a risk that its net profit does not match its operating cash flow, indicating potential discrepancies between reported earnings and actual cash generated from operations. Additionally, the level of net profit is described as being consistent with the compensation levels of the company's research and development personnel. An analysis of the impact of expensing research and development investments on net profit shows that this effect is relatively minor.&lt;SEP&gt;武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司reported净利润for each reporting period.&lt;SEP&gt;武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司reports净利润(net profit) values for various fiscal years.</data>
