    <edge source="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司" target="军方">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 军方 (the military) and 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 (Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd.) is that of a primary customer and key supplier. The military serves as both the end user and the main client for the company, with over 90% of the company's main business revenue coming directly or indirectly from military sources. The company sells its products to the military through both direct and indirect channels, and it is a key supplier of video command systems, ensuring compliance with military standards.

The military's procurement processes and project characteristics significantly influence the company's contract signing and payment collection cycles. Specifically, the payment progress for contracts is aligned with military funding progress, which directly affects the company's cash flow and financial planning. Additionally, the military's purchasing prices impact the prices that 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 can charge to its overall unit customers, thereby affecting the company's pricing strategy and profit margins. Orders from the military are a critical driver of the company's sales revenue, making the military an indispensable partner in the company's business operations.&lt;SEP&gt;武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司supplies products to the military, which follows a budget management and centralized procurement system.</data>
      <data key="d9">customer relationship,military procurement,payment dependency,progress alignment,sales channel,standard compliance,supplier,业务依赖,业务合作,供应链,客户关系,收入依赖,最终用户关系</data>
