    <edge source="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司" target="总体单位">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation (总体单位, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司) describes the business relationship between Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd. and its customers referred to as "总体单位" (general units or overall contractors). In this context, 总体单位 are clients of Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd., such as Unit A and Unit D, which undertake large-scale military projects. The company acts as a supporting unit in the military supply chain, selling system products and other goods to these overall contractors. The pricing for these products is negotiated based on military procurement prices. A key characteristic of this relationship is that the settlement cycle for payments from 总体单位 is long, leading to a relatively large scale of accounts receivable for the company. The balances and aging of these receivables from 总体单位 are disclosed by the company. The project scale of the 总体单位 directly influences the company's payment recovery cycle, and the overall payment cycle from these customers is notably extended.</data>
