    <edge source="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司" target="上海证券交易所">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 (Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd.) and 上海证券交易所 (Shanghai Stock Exchange, SSE) is primarily defined by the company's plan to list and trade its shares on the SSE's Science and Technology Innovation Board (科创板). The company intends to offer its stock for public trading on this specific board of the Shanghai Stock Exchange. As a listed entity, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 is subject to the comprehensive rules and regulatory framework established by the Shanghai Stock Exchange. This compliance extends to various operational and corporate governance areas, including adherence to regulations concerning share reduction, share repricing, and the identification and management of related-party transactions.</data>
      <data key="d9">compliance,listing,listing rules,regulation,regulatory compliance,stock exchange,trading venue,上市交易,上市交易所,监管关系,股票发行</data>
