    <edge source="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司" target="中国证监会">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 中国证监会 (China Securities Regulatory Commission, CSRC) and 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 (Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd.) is one of regulatory oversight and compliance. The CSRC exercises authority over the company's issuance of securities, including making decisions or issuing opinions regarding its public offerings and listing activities. The company's fundraising activities, including the use of raised capital, must adhere to regulations established by the CSRC. Furthermore, any adjustments to the company's profit distribution policies are subject to CSRC rules.

The company is required to comply with CSRC regulations concerning information disclosure and the identification of related parties. As part of these disclosure obligations, the company must make public announcements in newspapers designated by the CSRC, particularly when explaining the specific reasons for failing to fulfill commitments. Overall, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 operates under the continuous regulatory oversight of the 中国证监会, ensuring its compliance with securities laws and market conduct standards.</data>
