    <edge source="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司" target="淳中科技">
      <data key="d7">11.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 and 淳中科技 is primarily defined by their status as comparable peer companies within the video command and control system market, where they are considered direct competitors. 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 frequently uses 淳中科技 as a benchmark for financial and accounting comparisons. Specifically, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 compares its revenue recognition policy, gross margin, sales expense ratio (销售费用率), management expense ratio, and research and development (R&amp;D) investment with those of 淳中科技. Additionally, it compares its period expense ratios and inventory write-down policies and amounts against 淳中科技 to justify the reasonableness of its own accounting treatments.

A notable operational difference exists between the two companies, as 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 has a lower accounts receivable turnover rate than 淳中科技. This discrepancy is attributed to 淳中科技's focus on civilian products, which implies a different customer base and payment cycle compared to 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司. Overall, the relationship is characterized by competitive benchmarking and comparative financial analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司compared its solvency indicators with淳中科技in the prospectus.</data>
      <data key="d9">comparable company,comparison,competitor,different focus,financial analysis,industry analysis,industry comparison,management expense ratio,market competition,peer analysis,revenue policy comparison,solvency analysis,政策对比,行业比较</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-68fc75e0518c7a7c27f8e04edf36f2d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f076d85db2467f92db8296b25952dd82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a21b8abb483ef7500a33108065f62752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-225fc50e812ba7666027f5c412481f15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f50b98f3148cfa787df9553aa64c7e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b709c7a89c74bf17a7f106e614fdf37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4bdeea0b7d5b4b97d0e17580d16b8c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b6eddb53d74c83ec7f5f6b39738bdf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8176626e00ddc22142d6204442ab4426&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93fb79958d661926096c59442d227d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f3d7056e02a299ea6664597310ddb66</data>
