    <edge source="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司" target="上海瀚讯">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between 上海瀚讯 and 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 is characterized by the latter using the former as a peer or comparable company for various financial and operational benchmarking analyses. Specifically, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 compares its revenue recognition policy, gross margin, sales expense ratio (销售费用率), management expense ratio, research and development (R&amp;D) investment, and period expense ratios against those of 上海瀚讯. Additionally, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 compares its inventory write-down policy and amounts with 上海瀚讯 as a comparable entity.

Beyond financial metrics, the two companies share similarities in their client base, as both serve military clients. They also exhibit comparable accounts receivable turnover rates, further reinforcing their status as peers in the industry. Overall, 上海瀚讯 serves as a key benchmark for 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 in evaluating its financial performance, cost structures, and operational policies.&lt;SEP&gt;武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司compared its solvency indicators with上海瀚讯in the prospectus.</data>
