    <edge source="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司" target="景嘉微">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between 景嘉微 and 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 is primarily defined by the latter's use of the former as a peer or comparable company for financial and operational benchmarking. 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 compares its revenue recognition policy with that of 景嘉微, and also evaluates its gross margin against 景嘉微 as a peer company. In terms of expense management, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 compares its 销售费用率 (selling expense ratio) and its management expense ratio with those of 景嘉微. Additionally, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 benchmarks its research and development (R&amp;D) investment against 景嘉微, and compares its period expense ratios with those of 景嘉微 as a comparable company.

Beyond financial metrics, the two companies share operational similarities. Both 景嘉微 and 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 serve military clients, and they exhibit similar accounts receivable turnover rates. Furthermore, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 compares its inventory write-down policy and amounts with those of 景嘉微 as a comparable company. Overall, the relationship is characterized by 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 using 景嘉微 as a reference point for evaluating financial performance, expense structures, and accounting policies, underpinned by their shared client base in the military sector.&lt;SEP&gt;武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司compared its solvency indicators with景嘉微in the prospectus.</data>
