    <edge source="武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司" target="奥维通信股份有限公司">
      <data key="d7">13.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 奥维通信股份有限公司 (Allwin Communication Co., Ltd.) and 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 (Wuhan Xingtu Xinke Electronics Co., Ltd.) is a commercial partnership centered on the supply of specialized electronic products for military applications. 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 has entered into multiple contracts with 奥维通信股份有限公司, as evidenced by contract numbers XT2016038, XT2017040, XT2018131, and XT2018138. These agreements involve the delivery of video command and control products, which are utilized by 奥维通信股份有限公司 for various military video command system projects.

In this relationship, 奥维通信股份有限公司 acts as a significant integrator customer for 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, particularly noted as a top customer during the first half of 2019. The transactions primarily involve product sales and revenue recognition, with most orders from 奥维通信股份有限公司 being contingent upon end-user selection. Despite the importance of this customer, 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司 does not rely on 奥维通信股份有限公司 for its business operations, indicating a diversified customer base. The cooperation is thus characterized by a series of project-specific procurement arrangements rather than a dependency-based partnership.&lt;SEP&gt;奥维通信股份有限公司开具的银行承兑汇票已于2019年1月向武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司兑付。&lt;SEP&gt;武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司has accounts receivable from奥维通信股份有限公司, with partial post-period collections.&lt;SEP&gt;武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司settles with奥维通信股份有限公司via bank transfer and, in 2019, used 3-month commercial acceptance bills for some contracts.&lt;SEP&gt;The company entered into sales contracts with奥维通信股份有限公司for networked video command systems.</data>
      <data key="d9">accounts receivable,bank transfer,business relationship,business transaction,commercial acceptance bill,contract,contractual relationship,cooperation,customer contract,customer relationship,payment settlement,procurement,revenue,sales,sales contract,settlement policy,supplier relationship,supply agreement,不依赖,客户关系</data>
