      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Rising interest rates are a key factor behind the market selloff.&lt;SEP&gt;Rising interest rates are a key factor driving the market selloff.&lt;SEP&gt;Rising interest rates are a key concern driving the market selloff.&lt;SEP&gt;Rising interest rates are a key factor behind the market selloff.&lt;SEP&gt;Rising interest rates are a key concern driving the market selloff.</data>
