    <edge source="Rising Interest Rates" target="Federal Reserve">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Federal Reserve's potential rate hikes are a source of rising interest rates affecting the market.</data>
      <data key="d9">economic influence,monetary policy</data>
