    <edge source="Federal Reserve" target="Financial Experts">
      <data key="d7">36.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between the Federal Reserve and financial experts is characterized by intense scrutiny and anticipation. Financial experts are closely watching the Federal Reserve's next move, particularly regarding potential rate hikes and broader interest rate decisions. Their focus is on gauging the direction of the market and assessing the broader impact of the Federal Reserve's decisions on financial conditions and market stability. This monitoring reflects the experts' reliance on the central bank's policy signals to inform their analysis and expectations for economic and market outcomes.

Financial experts are consistently observing the Federal Reserve's actions and policy announcements to gauge future market conditions and market impact. This consistent observation underscores the critical role that Federal Reserve communications and policy decisions play in shaping the expectations and analytical frameworks of financial experts, as they seek to understand the direction of the market and the implications for financial stability.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial experts are closely watching the Federal Reserve's next move regarding potential rate hikes.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial experts are closely watching the Federal Reserve's next move to gauge market impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial experts are closely watching the Federal Reserve's next move to gauge potential rate hikes.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial experts are closely watching the Federal Reserve's next move to gauge potential rate hikes.</data>
      <data key="d9">analysis,anticipation,market analysis,monitoring,observation,policy analysis,policy anticipation,policy monitoring,policy speculation,speculation</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-838daaa18fa926fb2b11fc99c8bb90e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8455459f679507928ed432ed0eeb11a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e62b092bc60aebede5a38cd8af808a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8073427e62e9928dc9d4d2e1bf551bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-560cb7117e9d5c8fe2ebe3fce7fe2b14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bba9eac029b302aabf1571d3c8bb5ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f25bb161f5a3eed908ebf574181f3cc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-395c544cbdbc0fb5c7f956be865084b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2d90f0e9b01f197bbeb7088e31fb78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a96b26bf1a1bea07789c4fbf62c5edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abd183f52aef118cb63810c498ab8550&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e6ef010bba2a819545e29f981f9a6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aa3063ca8148fef0d6b0b98a6b6e563&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2969d49dd5c9133ebf9e2c6cfd697131&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-507e2b6ca2f473187fea2747ef444ec5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb09edb1098f9d43c10eb37e8eaf03aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fca02fbab0d237ce11800b5b73d4efd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03e343e9f8cca7465d3a833f634c92cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f958e8631e69a2a723215ed2bf5fee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80a754cb39a70a7b6942e8d85cc566af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9a0ecb1bc6254dade0144761cc9d208&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85051b285f1c500763f83db7eb74a280&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d012b93d8b658c8e32c326d8f1e487&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af143b0c95988c6fbd428d9191ea6fe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da8fc31188e449d6106dadda0587623f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-931e9f8ff947a254d2e37023beedf406&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24df38475c78597e2425c954a91f189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3de0c8b0c77ab6bc474ead023bc128f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae7a1fcdcb4ae2a56406409ff94164c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-639d3a16c46e2136422db5fe814162ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c51aa5d05f6f437fca7d5c1043da8ff1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf6871fb0e492a04ff169463c40073a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad4c2dae4e12654bb3e81ead3541cb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf933ea6ad543d32c5edbe9d972ca701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90d1dba7030dca02de5a3d5179699a79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5af88a45916f0db4a042242b4f213402</data>
