    <edge source="Financial Experts" target="Federal Reserve Policy Announcement">
      <data key="d7">90.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between a Federal Reserve Policy Announcement and Financial Experts is characterized by intense scrutiny and anticipation. Financial experts are closely watching the Federal Reserve's next move, specifically focusing on the upcoming policy announcement. Their attention is directed toward assessing the potential impact of this announcement, particularly regarding possible rate hikes. The primary concern for these experts is to evaluate how the policy decision will affect market stability and broader financial markets. They are consistently monitoring the announcement to gauge its overall impact on markets, with a specific emphasis on maintaining stability.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial experts are closely watching the Federal Reserve's next move.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial experts are closely watching the Federal Reserve's next move regarding policy announcements.</data>
