    <edge source="兴图投资" target="程家明">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between 兴图投资 and 程家明 is multifaceted, encompassing ownership, control, legal representation, and financial guarantee. 程家明 is the controlling shareholder of 兴图投资, holding a 55.85% stake in the entity, which makes him its控股股东 (controlling shareholder). Through this ownership, he exercises indirect control over the shares that 兴图投资 holds in 武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司, specifically a 19.28% equity stake. In addition to his ownership, 程家明 serves as the legal representative and Executive Director of 兴图投资, further solidifying his direct managerial and legal authority over the entity.

Furthermore, 兴图投资 was established solely for the purpose of holding shares in the issuer (武汉兴图新科电子股份有限公司), indicating that its primary function is as an investment vehicle. Beyond his role in corporate governance and ownership, 程家明 has also acted as a guarantor for 兴图投资, providing a personal guarantee for a loan obtained by the entity from 武汉美狄亚. This demonstrates a financial liability extending beyond his equity and directorial duties.</data>
      <data key="d9">control,employment,executive role,investment,legal representation,ownership,shareholding,保证担保,借款合同,持股,控制关系,控股关系,股权结构,间接控制</data>
