    <edge source="Supply Constraints" target="Rising Oil Prices">
      <data key="d7">24.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between rising oil prices and supply constraints is characterized by a direct, causal, and supportive dynamic. Supply constraints are consistently identified as a fundamental factor that drives, supports, and contributes to the rally and sustained elevation of crude oil prices. These constraints are described as a key driver and a significant factor in the upward movement of oil prices, reinforcing the notion that limitations in supply are a primary mechanism behind price increases.

The relationship is presented as direct and influential, with supply constraints acting as a core element in the sustained elevation of oil prices. Specifically, supply constraints in the oil market are a key factor supporting the rally in crude oil prices, contributing to the overall rise in oil prices. This dynamic underscores that when supply is limited, it creates upward pressure on prices, making supply constraints a primary mechanism behind the observed price increases.</data>
      <data key="d9">causation,market driver,market dynamic,market dynamics,market factor,price support,supply-demand dynamics</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-89db22b0e5a6074ecc3ea2ba20783879&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ba10301a1cc50aa00b42c346bc0be73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4426fe3d656d20408ebd50181707d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc982eece00e588340b45e4d5d4a2085&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e99024b6acfbff5fe61121f4e30753fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee4e0bc4d3f900c9271fab93b63caf3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e827ebe778b4fe39c952a40be61f9bc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-296a72753256021351c386543f50f98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3886638a85ee14393d1da2d826028ca5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb1ce8466eba9fca5a2139cfe96ff1c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecd4725f61a32f7fdf146cfa86e9ffbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03b79bbc9970c9b816e5baf5ef4c75ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f1a8aae31051ab5ad1792bad2f9b4a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99b50c91999c3bd07c0062342808aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f076d85db2467f92db8296b25952dd82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8227158700119014195f573b2aa0ea3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a8e0964a7d0c184c2475b3e18aba43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b6eddb53d74c83ec7f5f6b39738bdf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-639d3a16c46e2136422db5fe814162ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fd92cc11d15573cb1a2338cd9d65216&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-111667f7a7fdb09e88e60fc8c038a00e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-300a7f00696488d0691b1bffb9611757&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6fc09ed3694cfe56cf8f65ff5ee302c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-429754eb2ecdebc430531262f856dab5</data>
