      <data key="d8">Rising oil prices are reflected in the increase of crude oil futures to $87.60 per barrel.&lt;SEP&gt;Crude oil prices rose due to supply constraints and strong demand.&lt;SEP&gt;Crude oil prices rose due to supply constraints and strong demand.&lt;SEP&gt;Crude oil prices rose due to supply constraints and strong demand.&lt;SEP&gt;Crude oil prices rose to $87.60 per barrel as part of the rally in oil prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Crude oil prices rose to $87.60 per barrel as part of the broader rally.&lt;SEP&gt;Crude oil prices rose to $87.60 per barrel.</data>
