    <edge source="World Athletics Federation" target="100m Sprint Record">
      <data key="d7">84.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The World Athletics Federation is the governing body responsible for validating, regulating, certifying, and officially recognizing the 100m sprint record. This includes the general oversight of the record as well as the specific confirmation of records achieved by individual athletes. In particular, the Federation validates and officially recognizes the 100m sprint record set by Noah Carter.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Athletics Federation validates and officially recognizes the 100m sprint record.&lt;SEP&gt;The World Athletics Federation validates and recognizes the 100m sprint record.</data>
      <data key="d9">athletics,certification,official recognition,recognition,record validation,regulation,validation</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-1de8f0bd60c41437e1c137104382e47f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54697a6ffb1e9117eaabf2814055d30c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5876c16db338055a4b093d71d08df2e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7c58c5874ab4e09993f3857b27143d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4bd3436d1202e13a5f4ad72edab05da5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a09b6bc54fb44efe4b7c53573963ad2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3653af48a1ff4ba2209b77cafb2ed3f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4da0b72f01e2d9bde007a3a87db2ecf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e95dde1fdb1f24e6a29b46652f0b6795&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73018cc88f63622273f2f8654c27d498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87007ed5a3bb427e290e32a0b22cdeb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d1b068cb168a676da36f043f3c75a3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33c1f2b6fe1f7b2946b4c617d3984496&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d83bd67a4ed736ec4aa2ca49a9dd3ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c91e5a09e5b0bcbc71fef843955ccfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd227209a3be82add1bb0739321fb117&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb617c7dd4c80f8f2ee8c9dbb4f4b818&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0099d5a68aa2a54c0a612a238ad5ba37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e40d83cbd381962ff45bb45124711c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5207749aeb4beeb5cb43f59765accd02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24f5591069ef3450ba30dfe6745beb0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ea770b7c76363fae7c405ea9d01af81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb4d8cf35df3e1392a2369c7ae82c4af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44debc236b23da9b86648d962c1f4f55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1da7fb6b065e89f6fc545ce6a93ac1c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a04f7cc168a67cb2584f5cf93f3f9ab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-812ffe4fc5704125492b396c5e4fb113&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aeb8836413660bd47634ed3324963df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-198fa18d52f19aa670d3f722b2c8773b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1bba16bf66eb9542f477a57ce7dd357&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3cbd1cd4f955f7935adf7329e5d5b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54182f60d42d7ae398cdb80bfecd4e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-539084abf02778219d4ddbf72bcaedc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0aad161aad20232c5ce4abeb6e16bf7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09841b91427b70d08c09d01179754ec0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89e5db5e481b0a6599ada5721a69c705&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a268be32c2288ea8433062dd1b18f37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121435c233b4e42f43cc6985e1b95c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb7b1f3636d566f3ce04064fc78b9394&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0a095e584ed3b2151ee03451073aae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27ea7ffc6ed5